/* Legal Clinic translations, keyed by the English text. Not yet reviewed by native speakers. Bengali, Nepali, Tagalog and Vietnamese were completed on 31 October 2026 and need review most. */
window.CLINIC_I18N = {"id":{"Migration Jurisprudence from the South":"Pandangan Hukum Migrasi dari Dunia Berkembang","Where are you now?":"Anda sekarang berada di tahap mana?","Tap the step that fits you. You will see what to do and where to get help.":"Ketuk tahap yang sesuai dengan keadaan anda. Di sana anda akan melihat apa yang bisa dilakukan dan ke mana anda bisa mencari bantuan.","Before you leave":"Sebelum berangkat","An agent, fees or a promise of a job":"Agen, biaya, atau janji pekerjaan","Leaving the country":"Berangkat ke luar negeri","Papers, visa, exit rules":"Dokumen, visa, dan aturan keberangkatan","Working abroad":"Bekerja di luar negeri","Pay, hours, passport, abuse":"Gaji, jam kerja, paspor, dan kekerasan","Losing or changing the job":"Kehilangan atau pindah pekerjaan","Sent away, arrested, cannot change employer":"Dipulangkan, ditangkap, atau tidak bisa pindah majikan","Back home":"Sudah pulang","Claims after you return":"Gugatan setelah pulang","Keep every receipt and message from the agent. Ask for your contract in your own language before you pay anything.":"Simpan semua kuitansi dan pesan dari agen. Sebelum membayar apa pun, mintalah kontrak dalam bahasa yang anda bisa pahami sendiri.","Keep a copy of your passport, visa and contract with your family. Note the phone number of your embassy.":"Titipkan salinan paspor, visa, dan kontrak kepada keluarga. Selain itu, catat nomor telepon kedutaan negara anda.","In most countries an employer may not keep your passport. Write down unpaid wages, dates and hours. Courts have ruled for workers in cases like these.":"Di sebagian besar negara, majikan tidak boleh menahan paspor anda. Catat upah yang belum dibayar, beserta tanggal dan jam kerjanya. Pengadilan pernah memenangkan pekerja dalam perkara seperti ini.","Ask for a letter that says why the job ended. If you are detained, ask to contact your embassy.":"Mintalah surat yang menjelaskan alasan mengapa pekerjaan anda berakhir. Jika anda ditahan, mintalah untuk bisa menghubungi kedutaan negara anda.","In many cases you can still make a claim after you come home. Keep your documents. The Clinic can help you take the case to an international body.":"Dalam banyak perkara, anda tetap bisa menggugat setelah pulang. Simpan dokumen anda. Klinik bisa membantu membawa perkara tersebut ke badan internasional.","Could this be trafficking? Self-check →":"Apakah ini perdagangan orang? Cari tahu sendiri →","What your government promises →":"Apa yang dijanjikan oleh pemerintah anda →","Find free legal help →":"Cari bantuan hukum gratis →","What works where →":"Apa yang berhasil, dan di mana →","Prepare a rights communication →":"Siapkan pengaduan hak →","International Legal Clinic":"Klinik Hukum Internasional","Prepare a human rights communication":"Menyiapkan pengaduan hak asasi manusia","Answer a few questions about what happened. At the end you will see which international human rights mechanisms could receive the case, which cannot, and why. Then a guided form helps you draft the communication itself, which an IMR Clinic officer reviews before the next stage. There is no charge.":"Jawab beberapa pertanyaan tentang apa yang terjadi. Di akhir, anda akan melihat mekanisme hak asasi manusia internasional mana yang bisa menerima kasus ini, mana yang tidak, dan alasannya. Setelah itu, formulir terpandu membantu anda menyusun pengaduannya, yang akan ditinjau oleh petugas Klinik IMR sebelum tahap berikutnya. Tidak dipungut biaya.","Back":"Kembali","Next":"Lanjut","Your result":"Hasil anda","Mechanisms that could receive this case":"Mekanisme yang bisa menerima kasus ini","This checker is a guide, not legal advice. Rules change and every mechanism has further conditions, so the Clinic will check the details before anything is filed. Treaty acceptance for Indonesia was last checked in October 2026; for other countries, see the":"Alat ini adalah panduan, bukan nasihat hukum. Aturan bisa berubah dan setiap mekanisme punya syarat tambahan, jadi Klinik akan memeriksa rinciannya sebelum apa pun diajukan. Penerimaan perjanjian oleh Indonesia terakhir diperiksa pada Oktober 2026; untuk negara lain, lihat","OHCHR ratification dashboard":"dasbor ratifikasi OHCHR","Draft the communication":"Susun pengaduan","Fill in what you can. The page turns your answers into a draft communication in the form the chosen body expects. An IMR Clinic officer then reviews it with you before anything is filed. Nothing is sent to any international body from this page.":"Isi sebisanya. Halaman ini mengubah jawaban anda menjadi draf pengaduan sesuai bentuk yang diminta lembaga tujuan. Petugas Klinik IMR akan meninjaunya bersama anda sebelum apa pun diajukan. Tidak ada yang dikirim ke lembaga internasional dari halaman ini.","1. Where to send it":"1. Tujuan pengiriman","Mechanism":"Mekanisme","2. Author of the communication":"2. Pengirim pengaduan","Full name":"Nama lengkap","Nationality":"Kewarganegaraan","Date of birth":"Tanggal lahir","Safe contact: email, phone or WhatsApp":"Kontak yang aman: email, telepon atau WhatsApp","Are you the person affected?":"Apakah anda orang yang terdampak?","Yes":"Ya","No, I am acting for them":"Tidak, saya bertindak atas namanya","3. The person affected":"3. Orang yang terdampak","Where they are now":"Lokasinya sekarang","Your relationship to them, and whether they have agreed":"Hubungan anda dengannya, dan apakah ia sudah setuju","4. The State concerned":"4. Negara yang bertanggung jawab","Country":"Negara","5. The facts":"5. Fakta","What happened, in date order: who did what, when and where":"Apa yang terjadi, urut menurut tanggal: siapa melakukan apa, kapan dan di mana","6. Rights violated":"6. Hak yang dilanggar","Suggested from your answers for the chosen mechanism. Untick any that do not fit; the officer will refine them.":"Disarankan dari jawaban anda untuk mekanisme yang dipilih. Hapus centang yang tidak sesuai; petugas akan menyempurnakannya.","7. National remedies":"7. Upaya hukum nasional","Courts or authorities approached, with dates and results":"Pengadilan atau instansi yang didatangi, beserta tanggal dan hasilnya","If none were used, why not?":"Jika tidak ada yang ditempuh, mengapa?","8. Other international procedures":"8. Prosedur internasional lain","Has this been sent anywhere else? Give the body, date and result.":"Apakah kasus ini pernah dikirim ke tempat lain? Sebutkan lembaga, tanggal dan hasilnya.","9. What you are asking for":"9. Apa yang anda minta","Remedy sought (for example release, compensation, halting a deportation, investigation)":"Pemulihan yang diminta (misalnya pembebasan, ganti rugi, penghentian deportasi, penyelidikan)","Ask for urgent interim measures because someone is at immediate risk":"Minta tindakan sementara yang mendesak karena seseorang dalam bahaya langsung","10. Documents":"10. Dokumen","Documents you have (court decisions, medical reports, contracts, ID). Do not upload them here; the officer will ask for copies.":"Dokumen yang anda miliki (putusan pengadilan, laporan medis, kontrak, identitas). Jangan diunggah di sini; petugas akan meminta salinannya.","I agree that the Clinic may keep these details to assess the case, and will not share them without my permission.":"Saya setuju Klinik menyimpan data ini untuk menilai kasus, dan tidak akan membagikannya tanpa izin saya.","Preview the draft":"Lihat draf","Send to an IMR officer":"Kirim ke petugas IMR","Draft communication":"Draf pengaduan","Download draft (.doc)":"Unduh draf (.doc)","Print":"Cetak","Start again":"Mulai lagi","For example: brother, with written consent":"Misalnya: kakak, dengan persetujuan tertulis","Which government is responsible for what happened?":"Pemerintah negara mana yang bertanggung jawab atas kejadian ini?","Usually the country where it happened. If officials of one country acted abroad, choose that country.":"Biasanya negara tempat kejadian. Jika pejabat suatu negara bertindak di luar negeri, pilih negara tersebut.","What happened? Choose all that apply.":"Apa yang terjadi? Pilih semua yang sesuai.","Is someone at immediate risk?":"Apakah ada orang yang dalam bahaya langsung?","For example, a deportation in the next days, serious illness in detention, or threats to life.":"Misalnya deportasi dalam beberapa hari, sakit serius dalam tahanan, atau ancaman terhadap nyawa.","What has happened in the national courts or authorities?":"Apa yang sudah terjadi di pengadilan atau instansi nasional?","Most international bodies only hear a case after national remedies have been used.":"Sebagian besar lembaga internasional baru memeriksa kasus setelah upaya hukum nasional ditempuh.","When was the final national decision?":"Kapan putusan nasional terakhir?","Has the same case already been sent to another international body?":"Apakah kasus yang sama sudah dikirim ke lembaga internasional lain?","You can check on the OHCHR ratification dashboard (indicators.ohchr.org). If you are not sure, choose \"I don't know\" and the Clinic will check.":"Anda bisa memeriksanya di dasbor ratifikasi OHCHR (indicators.ohchr.org). Jika tidak yakin, pilih \"Saya tidak tahu\" dan Klinik akan memeriksanya.","Who would bring the case?":"Siapa yang akan mengajukan kasus?","Indonesia":"Indonesia","Another ASEAN country (for example Malaysia, Singapore, Thailand)":"Negara ASEAN lain (misalnya Malaysia, Singapura, Thailand)","A Council of Europe country (most of Europe, including the EU and the UK)":"Negara anggota Dewan Eropa (sebagian besar Eropa, termasuk Uni Eropa dan Inggris)","A country in the Americas (OAS member)":"Negara di benua Amerika (anggota OAS)","An African Union country":"Negara anggota Uni Afrika","A Gulf or Middle Eastern country":"Negara Teluk atau Timur Tengah","Somewhere else":"Negara lain","Torture, beatings or other ill-treatment":"Penyiksaan, pemukulan atau perlakuan buruk lainnya","Detention, including immigration detention":"Penahanan, termasuk penahanan imigrasi","Deportation or return to a country where the person is in danger":"Deportasi atau pemulangan ke negara tempat orang itu terancam bahaya","Seeking asylum or refugee protection":"Mencari suaka atau perlindungan pengungsi","Forced labor, trafficking or debt bondage":"Kerja paksa, perdagangan orang atau jeratan utang","Unpaid wages, unsafe work or other abuse at work":"Upah tidak dibayar, kerja tidak aman atau penyalahgunaan lain di tempat kerja","Discrimination because of race, nationality or religion":"Diskriminasi karena ras, kewarganegaraan atau agama","Violence or discrimination against a woman or girl":"Kekerasan atau diskriminasi terhadap perempuan atau anak perempuan","A child was affected":"Seorang anak ikut terdampak","Freedom of expression, religion, family life or a fair trial":"Kebebasan berekspresi, beragama, kehidupan keluarga atau peradilan yang adil","Health care, housing or education":"Layanan kesehatan, perumahan atau pendidikan","No":"Tidak","There is a final decision with no further appeal":"Sudah ada putusan akhir tanpa upaya banding lagi","A case is still going on":"Perkara masih berjalan","Nothing has been tried yet":"Belum ada yang ditempuh","It is not possible or not safe to use them, or they do not work":"Tidak mungkin atau tidak aman ditempuh, atau tidak efektif","Less than 4 months ago":"Kurang dari 4 bulan lalu","4 to 6 months ago":"4 sampai 6 bulan lalu","6 to 12 months ago":"6 sampai 12 bulan lalu","1 to 5 years ago":"1 sampai 5 tahun lalu","More than 5 years ago":"Lebih dari 5 tahun lalu","Yes, and it is still being examined":"Ya, dan masih diperiksa","Yes, and it has been decided":"Ya, dan sudah diputus","Yes, for the relevant treaty":"Ya, untuk perjanjian yang relevan","The person affected":"Orang yang terdampak","A relative or lawyer, with the person's consent":"Kerabat atau pengacara, dengan persetujuan orang tersebut","An organization such as a trade union or NGO":"Organisasi seperti serikat pekerja atau LSM","I don't know":"Saya tidak tahu","Question":"Pertanyaan","of":"dari","See the result":"Lihat hasil","Please choose an answer to continue.":"Pilih jawaban untuk melanjutkan.","Likely open":"Kemungkinan terbuka","Possible":"Mungkin","Possible, needs checking":"Mungkin, perlu diperiksa","Not yet":"Belum","Not available":"Tidak tersedia","Official page ↗":"Halaman resmi ↗","Mechanisms that could take the case now: {n}. Others may open later or need checking.":"Mekanisme yang bisa menerima kasus sekarang: {n}. Yang lain mungkin terbuka nanti atau perlu diperiksa.","The explanations below are in English. The Clinic can explain them in your language.":"Penjelasan di bawah ini dalam bahasa Inggris. Klinik bisa menjelaskannya dalam bahasa anda.","If someone is at immediate risk, contact the Clinic now":"Jika ada orang dalam bahaya langsung, hubungi Klinik sekarang","Translations have not yet been reviewed. If anything is unclear, the English version applies.":"Terjemahan belum ditinjau. Jika ada yang kurang jelas, versi bahasa Inggris yang berlaku.","Language":"Bahasa","Free of charge":"Gratis","About 15 minutes":"Sekitar 15 menit","Reviewed by an IMR lawyer":"Diperiksa oleh pengacara IMR","Nothing is filed without your agreement":"Tidak ada yang diajukan tanpa persetujuan anda","Check":"Periksa","Answer a few questions":"Jawab beberapa pertanyaan","Choose":"Pilih","See where the case can go":"Lihat ke mana kasus bisa dibawa","Draft and send":"Susun dan kirim","Write it, then send to IMR":"Tulis, lalu kirim ke IMR","Need help filling this in? Call the Clinic on":"Butuh bantuan mengisi? Telepon Klinik di","or email":"atau email","Where this case may go":"Ke mana kasus ini mungkin dibawa","Answer the first question to see a prediction.":"Jawab pertanyaan pertama untuk melihat perkiraan.","The prediction changes as you answer. It is a guide, not legal advice.":"Perkiraan berubah sesuai jawaban anda. Ini panduan, bukan nasihat hukum.","Strong fit":"Sangat cocok","Good fit":"Cocok","Show":"Tampilkan","Hide":"Sembunyikan","Predicted fit":"Perkiraan kecocokan","Listen":"Dengarkan","Where this case could go":"Ke mana kasus ini bisa dibawa","Can take the case now":"Bisa menerima kasus sekarang","May open later, or needs checking":"Mungkin terbuka nanti, atau perlu diperiksa","Not available for this case":"Tidak tersedia untuk kasus ini","Draft for this body →":"Susun untuk badan ini →","Guides and model forms":"Panduan dan formulir contoh","Draft the communication →":"Susun pengaduannya →","Where to send it, and who you are":"Ke mana dikirim, dan siapa anda","Choose the body for this draft. You can change it later.":"Pilih badan untuk draf ini. Anda bisa mengubahnya nanti.","About you":"Tentang anda","(optional)":"(tidak wajib)","The person affected and the State":"Orang yang dirugikan dan Negara","Tell us about the person whose rights were violated.":"Ceritakan tentang orang yang haknya dilanggar.","The State concerned":"Negara yang bersangkutan","Country responsible":"Negara yang bertanggung jawab","What happened":"Apa yang terjadi","Describe the events in date order, in your own words and in any language. The Clinic will help with the legal wording.":"Ceritakan kejadiannya berurutan menurut tanggal, dengan kata-kata anda sendiri dan dalam bahasa apa pun. Klinik akan membantu dengan bahasa hukumnya.","You can speak instead of writing.":"Anda bisa berbicara, tidak perlu menulis.","Press the red button and tell us what happened, in your own language. Up to 5 minutes.":"Tekan tombol merah dan ceritakan apa yang terjadi, dalam bahasa anda sendiri. Paling lama 5 menit.","Record my story":"Rekam cerita saya","Stop recording":"Berhenti merekam","Delete and record again":"Hapus dan rekam lagi","or write it":"atau tuliskan","The facts":"Fakta","A strong account usually says:":"Cerita yang kuat biasanya menyebutkan:","who did what, when and where, with dates if you know them;":"siapa melakukan apa, kapan dan di mana, dengan tanggal jika anda tahu;","what officials did or failed to do;":"apa yang dilakukan atau tidak dilakukan pejabat;","the harm caused, and what is happening now.":"kerugian yang terjadi, dan apa yang terjadi sekarang.","Rights and remedies":"Hak dan upaya pemulihan","These rights are suggested from your answers for the body you chose. Untick any that do not fit; the officer will refine them.":"Hak-hak ini disarankan dari jawaban anda untuk badan yang anda pilih. Hapus centang yang tidak sesuai; petugas akan menyempurnakannya.","National remedies":"Upaya hukum nasional","Other international procedures":"Prosedur internasional lain","What you are asking for":"Apa yang anda minta","Remedy sought":"Pemulihan yang diminta","(for example release, compensation, halting a deportation, an investigation)":"(misalnya pembebasan, ganti rugi, penghentian deportasi, penyelidikan)","Documents":"Dokumen","Documents you have":"Dokumen yang anda miliki","(court decisions, medical reports, contracts, ID). Do not upload them here; the officer will ask for copies.":"(putusan pengadilan, laporan medis, kontrak, kartu identitas). Jangan unggah di sini; petugas akan meminta salinannya.","Review and send":"Periksa dan kirim","Read the draft below. When you send it, it goes only to the IMR International Legal Clinic, not to any international body. An officer will contact you to review it.":"Baca draf di bawah. Jika anda mengirimnya, draf hanya sampai ke Klinik Hukum Internasional IMR, bukan ke badan internasional mana pun. Petugas akan menghubungi anda untuk memeriksanya.","Your reference:":"Nomor referensi anda:","Keep it in case you need to contact the Clinic.":"Simpan nomor ini jika anda perlu menghubungi Klinik.","How we handle your data: the form is stored by our web host, Netlify, whose servers are mostly in the United States, and is then read only by Clinic staff. If that is a risk for you, download the draft instead and send it to":"Cara kami menangani data anda: formulir disimpan oleh penyedia situs kami, Netlify, yang servernya sebagian besar di Amerika Serikat, lalu hanya dibaca oleh staf Klinik. Jika itu berisiko bagi anda, unduh draf ini dan kirimkan ke","or bring it to the Clinic.":"atau bawa ke Klinik.","Download (.doc)":"Unduh (.doc)","Send to an IMR lawyer":"Kirim ke pengacara IMR","Step":"Langkah","← Back to results":"← Kembali ke hasil","Live preview":"Pratinjau langsung","Sending…":"Mengirim…","The draft could not be sent just now.":"Draf belum bisa dikirim saat ini.","Microphone not allowed. Please write instead.":"Mikrofon tidak diizinkan. Silakan tulis saja.","Draft in your language":"Draf dalam bahasa anda","Draft in English":"Draf dalam bahasa Inggris","DRAFT FOR REVIEW BY THE IMR INTERNATIONAL LEGAL CLINIC. NOT YET SUBMITTED.":"DRAF UNTUK DIPERIKSA OLEH KLINIK HUKUM INTERNASIONAL IMR. BELUM DIAJUKAN.","To":"Kepada","Type":"Jenis","Date":"Tanggal","IMR reference":"Referensi IMR","INFORMATION ON THE AUTHOR":"INFORMASI TENTANG PENGADU","Name":"Nama","Address for correspondence":"Alamat surat-menyurat","to be completed with the Clinic":"akan dilengkapi bersama Klinik","INFORMATION ON THE ALLEGED VICTIM":"INFORMASI TENTANG KORBAN","The author is the alleged victim.":"Pengadu adalah korban.","Present location":"Lokasi saat ini","Authority to act":"Kuasa untuk bertindak","written consent of the victim to be attached":"persetujuan tertulis korban akan dilampirkan","STATE CONCERNED":"NEGARA YANG BERSANGKUTAN","FACTS OF THE CASE":"FAKTA KASUS","RIGHTS ALLEGED TO HAVE BEEN VIOLATED":"HAK YANG DIDUGA DILANGGAR","to be identified":"akan ditentukan","EXHAUSTION OF DOMESTIC REMEDIES":"UPAYA HUKUM DALAM NEGERI YANG TELAH DITEMPUH","Remedies unavailable or ineffective because":"Upaya hukum tidak tersedia atau tidak efektif karena","OTHER INTERNATIONAL PROCEDURES":"PROSEDUR INTERNASIONAL LAIN","REMEDY SOUGHT":"PEMULIHAN YANG DIMINTA","Request for interim measures":"Permohonan tindakan sementara","the author asks that the State be requested to take interim measures to avoid irreparable harm to the alleged victim while the communication is under consideration.":"pengadu meminta agar Negara diminta mengambil tindakan sementara untuk mencegah kerugian yang tidak bisa dipulihkan bagi korban selama pengaduan diperiksa.","SUPPORTING DOCUMENTS":"DOKUMEN PENDUKUNG","to be listed":"akan didaftar","Signature":"Tanda tangan","not yet given":"belum diisi","The same matter has not been submitted to any other procedure of international investigation or settlement.":"Perkara yang sama belum diajukan ke prosedur penyelidikan atau penyelesaian internasional lain mana pun.","Told in a voice message, attached. The Clinic will transcribe it.":"Diceritakan dalam pesan audio, terlampir. Klinik akan menuliskannya.","A voice message is also attached.":"Pesan audio juga dilampirkan.","Draft for IMR review · not yet submitted":"Draf untuk diperiksa IMR · belum diajukan","Easy mode: big pictures, questions read aloud":"Mode mudah: gambar besar, pertanyaan dibacakan","Recruiting agency and employer":"Agen perekrut dan majikan","(if any)":"(jika ada)","Recruiting agency or agent":"Agen perekrut atau calo","Name of the company or person who arranged the job":"Nama perusahaan atau orang yang mengurus pekerjaan","Employer":"Majikan","Name of the employer, farm or household":"Nama majikan, kebun atau rumah tangga","Which country?":"Negara yang mana?","I'm not sure":"Saya tidak yakin","Choose a country":"Pilih negara","Has that country accepted individual communications to UN treaty committees?":"Apakah negara itu menerima komunikasi perorangan ke komite perjanjian PBB?","Find out which international bodies can hear your case. Then draft your rights communication step by step, and an IMR lawyer reviews it with you before anything is filed.":"Cari tahu badan internasional mana yang bisa memeriksa kasus anda. Lalu susun pengaduan hak anda langkah demi langkah, dan pengacara IMR akan memeriksanya bersama anda sebelum apa pun diajukan.","This lets us check which UN communication procedures that country has accepted.":"Ini membantu kami memeriksa prosedur komunikasi PBB mana yang telah diterima negara itu.","Before anything is filed, the person affected must sign an authorization letting you, or IMR, act for them. If they cannot sign, for example because they are detained, the Clinic officer will explain what can be done instead.":"Sebelum apa pun diajukan, orang yang terdampak harus menandatangani surat kuasa yang mengizinkan anda, atau IMR, bertindak atas namanya. Jika ia tidak bisa menandatangani, misalnya karena ditahan, petugas Klinik akan menjelaskan apa yang bisa dilakukan."},"ar":{"International Legal Clinic":"العيادة القانونية الدولية","Prepare a human rights communication":"إعداد بلاغ بشأن حقوق الإنسان","Answer a few questions about what happened. At the end you will see which international human rights mechanisms could receive the case, which cannot, and why. Then a guided form helps you draft the communication itself, which an IMR Clinic officer reviews before the next stage. There is no charge.":"أجب عن بعض الأسئلة حول ما حدث. في النهاية سترى آليات حقوق الإنسان الدولية التي يمكن أن تتلقى القضية، والتي لا يمكنها ذلك، وسبب ذلك. بعد ذلك يساعدك نموذج موجَّه على صياغة البلاغ نفسه، ويراجعه موظف في عيادة المعهد قبل المرحلة التالية. الخدمة مجانية.","Back":"رجوع","Next":"التالي","Your result":"النتيجة","Mechanisms that could receive this case":"الآليات التي يمكن أن تتلقى هذه القضية","This checker is a guide, not legal advice. Rules change and every mechanism has further conditions, so the Clinic will check the details before anything is filed. Treaty acceptance for Indonesia was last checked in October 2026; for other countries, see the":"هذه الأداة دليل وليست استشارة قانونية. القواعد تتغير ولكل آلية شروط إضافية، لذلك ستتحقق العيادة من التفاصيل قبل تقديم أي شيء. تم التحقق من قبول إندونيسيا للمعاهدات آخر مرة في أكتوبر 2026؛ وبالنسبة للدول الأخرى، راجع","OHCHR ratification dashboard":"لوحة التصديقات لدى المفوضية السامية لحقوق الإنسان","Draft the communication":"صياغة البلاغ","Fill in what you can. The page turns your answers into a draft communication in the form the chosen body expects. An IMR Clinic officer then reviews it with you before anything is filed. Nothing is sent to any international body from this page.":"املأ ما تستطيع. تحوّل هذه الصفحة إجاباتك إلى مسودة بلاغ بالشكل الذي تطلبه الجهة المختارة. ثم يراجعها معك موظف في عيادة المعهد قبل تقديم أي شيء. لا يُرسل أي شيء إلى أي جهة دولية من هذه الصفحة.","1. Where to send it":"1. الجهة المرسل إليها","Mechanism":"الآلية","2. Author of the communication":"2. مقدّم البلاغ","Full name":"الاسم الكامل","Nationality":"الجنسية","Date of birth":"تاريخ الميلاد","Safe contact: email, phone or WhatsApp":"وسيلة اتصال آمنة: بريد إلكتروني أو هاتف أو واتساب","Are you the person affected?":"هل أنت الشخص المتضرر؟","Yes":"نعم","No, I am acting for them":"لا، أنا أتصرف نيابة عنه","3. The person affected":"3. الشخص المتضرر","Where they are now":"مكان وجوده الآن","Your relationship to them, and whether they have agreed":"صلتك به، وهل وافق على ذلك","4. The State concerned":"4. الدولة المعنية","Country":"الدولة","5. The facts":"5. الوقائع","What happened, in date order: who did what, when and where":"ما حدث بالترتيب الزمني: من فعل ماذا، ومتى، وأين","6. Rights violated":"6. الحقوق المنتهكة","Suggested from your answers for the chosen mechanism. Untick any that do not fit; the officer will refine them.":"مقترحة بناءً على إجاباتك للآلية المختارة. أزل العلامة عما لا يناسب؛ وسيدققها الموظف.","7. National remedies":"7. سبل الانتصاف الوطنية","Courts or authorities approached, with dates and results":"المحاكم أو السلطات التي لجأت إليها، مع التواريخ والنتائج","If none were used, why not?":"إذا لم تلجأ إلى أي منها، فلماذا؟","8. Other international procedures":"8. إجراءات دولية أخرى","Has this been sent anywhere else? Give the body, date and result.":"هل أُرسلت هذه القضية إلى جهة أخرى؟ اذكر الجهة والتاريخ والنتيجة.","9. What you are asking for":"9. ما الذي تطلبه","Remedy sought (for example release, compensation, halting a deportation, investigation)":"الانتصاف المطلوب (مثل الإفراج أو التعويض أو وقف الترحيل أو التحقيق)","Ask for urgent interim measures because someone is at immediate risk":"طلب تدابير مؤقتة عاجلة لأن شخصًا ما في خطر مباشر","10. Documents":"10. المستندات","Documents you have (court decisions, medical reports, contracts, ID). Do not upload them here; the officer will ask for copies.":"المستندات المتوفرة لديك (أحكام قضائية، تقارير طبية، عقود، هوية). لا ترفعها هنا؛ سيطلب الموظف نسخًا منها.","I agree that the Clinic may keep these details to assess the case, and will not share them without my permission.":"أوافق على أن تحتفظ العيادة بهذه البيانات لتقييم القضية، وألا تشاركها دون إذني.","Preview the draft":"معاينة المسودة","Send to an IMR officer":"إرسال إلى موظف المعهد","Draft communication":"مسودة البلاغ","Download draft (.doc)":"تنزيل المسودة (.doc)","Print":"طباعة","Start again":"البدء من جديد","For example: brother, with written consent":"مثال: أخ، بموافقة مكتوبة","Which government is responsible for what happened?":"أي حكومة مسؤولة عما حدث؟","Usually the country where it happened. If officials of one country acted abroad, choose that country.":"عادةً الدولة التي وقع فيها الحدث. إذا تصرف مسؤولو دولة ما في الخارج، فاختر تلك الدولة.","What happened? Choose all that apply.":"ماذا حدث؟ اختر كل ما ينطبق.","Is someone at immediate risk?":"هل هناك شخص في خطر مباشر؟","For example, a deportation in the next days, serious illness in detention, or threats to life.":"مثل ترحيل خلال الأيام القادمة، أو مرض خطير أثناء الاحتجاز، أو تهديد للحياة.","What has happened in the national courts or authorities?":"ما الذي حدث أمام المحاكم أو السلطات الوطنية؟","Most international bodies only hear a case after national remedies have been used.":"معظم الهيئات الدولية لا تنظر في القضية إلا بعد استنفاد سبل الانتصاف الوطنية.","When was the final national decision?":"متى صدر القرار الوطني النهائي؟","Has the same case already been sent to another international body?":"هل أُرسلت القضية نفسها إلى هيئة دولية أخرى؟","You can check on the OHCHR ratification dashboard (indicators.ohchr.org). If you are not sure, choose \"I don't know\" and the Clinic will check.":"يمكنك التحقق من ذلك في لوحة التصديقات (indicators.ohchr.org). إذا لم تكن متأكدًا، فاختر \"لا أعرف\" وستتحقق العيادة.","Who would bring the case?":"من سيقدم القضية؟","Indonesia":"إندونيسيا","Another ASEAN country (for example Malaysia, Singapore, Thailand)":"دولة أخرى في آسيان (مثل ماليزيا أو سنغافورة أو تايلاند)","A Council of Europe country (most of Europe, including the EU and the UK)":"دولة عضو في مجلس أوروبا (معظم أوروبا، بما فيها الاتحاد الأوروبي والمملكة المتحدة)","A country in the Americas (OAS member)":"دولة في الأمريكتين (عضو في منظمة الدول الأمريكية)","An African Union country":"دولة عضو في الاتحاد الأفريقي","A Gulf or Middle Eastern country":"دولة خليجية أو في الشرق الأوسط","Somewhere else":"مكان آخر","Torture, beatings or other ill-treatment":"التعذيب أو الضرب أو غيره من سوء المعاملة","Detention, including immigration detention":"الاحتجاز، بما في ذلك احتجاز المهاجرين","Deportation or return to a country where the person is in danger":"الترحيل أو الإعادة إلى بلد يكون فيه الشخص في خطر","Seeking asylum or refugee protection":"طلب اللجوء أو الحماية كلاجئ","Forced labor, trafficking or debt bondage":"العمل القسري أو الاتجار بالبشر أو عبودية الدين","Unpaid wages, unsafe work or other abuse at work":"أجور غير مدفوعة أو عمل غير آمن أو إساءة أخرى في العمل","Discrimination because of race, nationality or religion":"التمييز بسبب العرق أو الجنسية أو الدين","Violence or discrimination against a woman or girl":"العنف أو التمييز ضد امرأة أو فتاة","A child was affected":"تضرر طفل","Freedom of expression, religion, family life or a fair trial":"حرية التعبير أو الدين أو الحياة الأسرية أو المحاكمة العادلة","Health care, housing or education":"الرعاية الصحية أو السكن أو التعليم","No":"لا","There is a final decision with no further appeal":"صدر قرار نهائي غير قابل للطعن","A case is still going on":"القضية لا تزال جارية","Nothing has been tried yet":"لم يُتخذ أي إجراء بعد","It is not possible or not safe to use them, or they do not work":"لا يمكن أو ليس من الآمن اللجوء إليها، أو أنها غير فعالة","Less than 4 months ago":"قبل أقل من 4 أشهر","4 to 6 months ago":"قبل 4 إلى 6 أشهر","6 to 12 months ago":"قبل 6 إلى 12 شهرًا","1 to 5 years ago":"قبل سنة إلى 5 سنوات","More than 5 years ago":"قبل أكثر من 5 سنوات","Yes, and it is still being examined":"نعم، ولا تزال قيد النظر","Yes, and it has been decided":"نعم، وقد صدر فيها قرار","Yes, for the relevant treaty":"نعم، بالنسبة للمعاهدة المعنية","The person affected":"الشخص المتضرر","A relative or lawyer, with the person's consent":"قريب أو محامٍ، بموافقة الشخص","An organization such as a trade union or NGO":"منظمة مثل نقابة عمالية أو منظمة غير حكومية","I don't know":"لا أعرف","Question":"السؤال","of":"من","See the result":"عرض النتيجة","Please choose an answer to continue.":"يرجى اختيار إجابة للمتابعة.","Likely open":"مفتوحة على الأرجح","Possible":"ممكنة","Possible, needs checking":"ممكنة، تحتاج إلى تحقق","Not yet":"ليس بعد","Not available":"غير متاحة","Official page ↗":"الصفحة الرسمية ↗","Mechanisms that could take the case now: {n}. Others may open later or need checking.":"عدد الآليات التي يمكنها تلقي القضية الآن: {n}. قد تُفتح أخرى لاحقًا أو تحتاج إلى تحقق.","The explanations below are in English. The Clinic can explain them in your language.":"الشروح أدناه باللغة الإنجليزية. يمكن للعيادة شرحها بلغتك.","If someone is at immediate risk, contact the Clinic now":"إذا كان شخص ما في خطر مباشر، فاتصل بالعيادة الآن","Translations have not yet been reviewed. If anything is unclear, the English version applies.":"لم تتم مراجعة الترجمات بعد. إذا كان هناك أمر غير واضح، فالنسخة الإنجليزية هي المعتمدة.","Language":"اللغة","Free of charge":"مجاناً","About 15 minutes":"حوالي 15 دقيقة","Reviewed by an IMR lawyer":"يراجعها محامٍ من IMR","Nothing is filed without your agreement":"لا يُقدَّم شيء دون موافقتك","Check":"تحقّق","Answer a few questions":"أجب عن بعض الأسئلة","Choose":"اختر","See where the case can go":"اعرف إلى أين يمكن أن تذهب القضية","Draft and send":"اكتب وأرسل","Write it, then send to IMR":"اكتبها، ثم أرسلها إلى IMR","Need help filling this in? Call the Clinic on":"تحتاج مساعدة في التعبئة؟ اتصل بالعيادة على","or email":"أو البريد الإلكتروني","Where this case may go":"إلى أين قد تذهب هذه القضية","Answer the first question to see a prediction.":"أجب عن السؤال الأول لترى التوقّع.","The prediction changes as you answer. It is a guide, not legal advice.":"يتغيّر التوقّع مع إجاباتك. إنه دليل وليس استشارة قانونية.","Strong fit":"مناسب جداً","Good fit":"مناسب","Show":"إظهار","Hide":"إخفاء","Predicted fit":"مدى الملاءمة المتوقَّع","Listen":"استمع","Where this case could go":"إلى أين يمكن أن تذهب هذه القضية","Can take the case now":"يمكنها قبول القضية الآن","May open later, or needs checking":"قد تُفتح لاحقاً، أو تحتاج إلى تحقّق","Not available for this case":"غير متاحة لهذه القضية","Draft for this body →":"اكتب لهذه الهيئة ←","Guides and model forms":"أدلّة ونماذج","Draft the communication →":"اكتب البلاغ ←","Where to send it, and who you are":"إلى أين تُرسَل، ومن أنت","Choose the body for this draft. You can change it later.":"اختر الهيئة لهذه المسودة. يمكنك تغييرها لاحقاً.","About you":"عنك","(optional)":"(اختياري)","The person affected and the State":"الشخص المتضرّر والدولة","Tell us about the person whose rights were violated.":"أخبرنا عن الشخص الذي انتُهكت حقوقه.","The State concerned":"الدولة المعنية","Country responsible":"الدولة المسؤولة","What happened":"ماذا حدث","Describe the events in date order, in your own words and in any language. The Clinic will help with the legal wording.":"صِف الأحداث بترتيب التواريخ، بكلماتك وبأي لغة. ستساعدك العيادة في الصياغة القانونية.","You can speak instead of writing.":"يمكنك التحدث بدلاً من الكتابة.","Press the red button and tell us what happened, in your own language. Up to 5 minutes.":"اضغط الزر الأحمر واحكِ ما حدث بلغتك. حتى 5 دقائق.","Record my story":"سجّل قصتي","Stop recording":"أوقف التسجيل","Delete and record again":"احذف وسجّل من جديد","or write it":"أو اكتبها","The facts":"الوقائع","A strong account usually says:":"الرواية القوية تذكر عادةً:","who did what, when and where, with dates if you know them;":"من فعل ماذا، ومتى وأين، مع التواريخ إن كنت تعرفها؛","what officials did or failed to do;":"ما فعله المسؤولون أو ما لم يفعلوه؛","the harm caused, and what is happening now.":"الضرر الذي وقع، وما يحدث الآن.","Rights and remedies":"الحقوق وسُبل الانتصاف","These rights are suggested from your answers for the body you chose. Untick any that do not fit; the officer will refine them.":"هذه الحقوق مقترحة من إجاباتك للهيئة التي اخترتها. أزل العلامة عمّا لا يناسب؛ وسيضبطها الموظف.","National remedies":"سُبل الانتصاف الوطنية","Other international procedures":"إجراءات دولية أخرى","What you are asking for":"ماذا تطلب","Remedy sought":"الانتصاف المطلوب","(for example release, compensation, halting a deportation, an investigation)":"(مثل الإفراج، أو التعويض، أو وقف الترحيل، أو التحقيق)","Documents":"المستندات","Documents you have":"المستندات التي لديك","(court decisions, medical reports, contracts, ID). Do not upload them here; the officer will ask for copies.":"(أحكام قضائية، تقارير طبية، عقود، هوية). لا ترفعها هنا؛ سيطلب الموظف نسخاً منها.","Review and send":"راجع وأرسل","Read the draft below. When you send it, it goes only to the IMR International Legal Clinic, not to any international body. An officer will contact you to review it.":"اقرأ المسودة أدناه. عندما ترسلها، تصل فقط إلى العيادة القانونية الدولية في IMR، وليس إلى أي هيئة دولية. سيتصل بك موظف لمراجعتها.","Your reference:":"رقمك المرجعي:","Keep it in case you need to contact the Clinic.":"احتفظ به في حال احتجت إلى التواصل مع العيادة.","How we handle your data: the form is stored by our web host, Netlify, whose servers are mostly in the United States, and is then read only by Clinic staff. If that is a risk for you, download the draft instead and send it to":"كيف نتعامل مع بياناتك: يُحفظ النموذج لدى مضيف موقعنا Netlify، وخوادمه في الغالب في الولايات المتحدة، ثم لا يقرؤه إلا موظفو العيادة. إن كان ذلك خطراً عليك، فنزّل المسودة وأرسلها إلى","or bring it to the Clinic.":"أو أحضرها إلى العيادة.","Download (.doc)":"تنزيل (.doc)","Send to an IMR lawyer":"أرسل إلى محامٍ من IMR","Step":"خطوة","← Back to results":"→ العودة إلى النتائج","Live preview":"معاينة مباشرة","Sending…":"جارٍ الإرسال…","The draft could not be sent just now.":"تعذّر إرسال المسودة الآن.","Microphone not allowed. Please write instead.":"لم يُسمح باستخدام الميكروفون. يُرجى الكتابة بدلاً من ذلك.","Draft in your language":"المسودة بلغتك","Draft in English":"المسودة بالإنجليزية","DRAFT FOR REVIEW BY THE IMR INTERNATIONAL LEGAL CLINIC. NOT YET SUBMITTED.":"مسودة للمراجعة من العيادة القانونية الدولية في IMR. لم تُقدَّم بعد.","To":"إلى","Type":"النوع","Date":"التاريخ","IMR reference":"مرجع IMR","INFORMATION ON THE AUTHOR":"معلومات عن صاحب البلاغ","Name":"الاسم","Address for correspondence":"عنوان المراسلة","to be completed with the Clinic":"يُستكمل مع العيادة","INFORMATION ON THE ALLEGED VICTIM":"معلومات عن الضحية المزعومة","The author is the alleged victim.":"صاحب البلاغ هو الضحية.","Present location":"المكان الحالي","Authority to act":"صفة التصرف","written consent of the victim to be attached":"تُرفق موافقة الضحية الخطية","STATE CONCERNED":"الدولة المعنية","FACTS OF THE CASE":"وقائع القضية","RIGHTS ALLEGED TO HAVE BEEN VIOLATED":"الحقوق المدّعى انتهاكها","to be identified":"تُحدَّد لاحقاً","EXHAUSTION OF DOMESTIC REMEDIES":"استنفاد سُبل الانتصاف المحلية","Remedies unavailable or ineffective because":"سُبل الانتصاف غير متاحة أو غير فعّالة لأن","OTHER INTERNATIONAL PROCEDURES":"إجراءات دولية أخرى","REMEDY SOUGHT":"الانتصاف المطلوب","Request for interim measures":"طلب تدابير مؤقتة","the author asks that the State be requested to take interim measures to avoid irreparable harm to the alleged victim while the communication is under consideration.":"يطلب صاحب البلاغ أن يُطلب من الدولة اتخاذ تدابير مؤقتة لتجنّب ضرر لا يمكن إصلاحه بالضحية أثناء النظر في البلاغ.","SUPPORTING DOCUMENTS":"المستندات الداعمة","to be listed":"تُدرَج لاحقاً","Signature":"التوقيع","not yet given":"لم يُذكر بعد","The same matter has not been submitted to any other procedure of international investigation or settlement.":"لم تُقدَّم المسألة نفسها إلى أي إجراء آخر من إجراءات التحقيق أو التسوية الدولية.","Told in a voice message, attached. The Clinic will transcribe it.":"رُويت في رسالة صوتية مرفقة. ستكتبها العيادة.","A voice message is also attached.":"رسالة صوتية مرفقة أيضاً.","Draft for IMR review · not yet submitted":"مسودة لمراجعة IMR · لم تُقدَّم بعد","Easy mode: big pictures, questions read aloud":"الوضع السهل: صور كبيرة، وتُقرأ الأسئلة بصوت عالٍ","Recruiting agency and employer":"وكالة التوظيف وصاحب العمل","(if any)":"(إن وُجد)","Recruiting agency or agent":"وكالة التوظيف أو الوسيط","Name of the company or person who arranged the job":"اسم الشركة أو الشخص الذي رتّب العمل","Employer":"صاحب العمل","Name of the employer, farm or household":"اسم صاحب العمل أو المزرعة أو الأسرة","Which country?":"أي دولة؟","I'm not sure":"لست متأكدًا","Choose a country":"اختر دولة","Has that country accepted individual communications to UN treaty committees?":"هل قبلت تلك الدولة البلاغات الفردية أمام لجان معاهدات الأمم المتحدة؟","Find out which international bodies can hear your case. Then draft your rights communication step by step, and an IMR lawyer reviews it with you before anything is filed.":"اعرف أي الهيئات الدولية يمكنها النظر في قضيتك. ثم اكتب بلاغك الحقوقي خطوة بخطوة، وسيراجعه معك محامٍ من IMR قبل تقديم أي شيء.","This lets us check which UN communication procedures that country has accepted.":"يساعدنا هذا على معرفة إجراءات البلاغات الأممية التي قبلتها تلك الدولة.","Before anything is filed, the person affected must sign an authorization letting you, or IMR, act for them. If they cannot sign, for example because they are detained, the Clinic officer will explain what can be done instead.":"قبل تقديم أي شيء، يجب أن يوقّع الشخص المتضرر تفويضًا يسمح لك، أو لـ IMR، بالتصرف نيابةً عنه. إذا لم يستطع التوقيع، مثلًا لأنه محتجز، سيشرح لك موظف العيادة ما يمكن فعله بدلًا من ذلك."},"fa":{"International Legal Clinic":"کلینیک حقوقی بین‌المللی","Prepare a human rights communication":"تهیه شکایت حقوق بشری","Answer a few questions about what happened. At the end you will see which international human rights mechanisms could receive the case, which cannot, and why. Then a guided form helps you draft the communication itself, which an IMR Clinic officer reviews before the next stage. There is no charge.":"به چند پرسش درباره آنچه رخ داده پاسخ دهید. در پایان می‌بینید کدام سازوکارهای بین‌المللی حقوق بشر می‌توانند پرونده را بپذیرند، کدام نمی‌توانند و چرا. سپس یک فرم راهنما به شما کمک می‌کند خود شکایت را بنویسید و یکی از کارکنان کلینیک آن را پیش از مرحله بعد بررسی می‌کند. این خدمت رایگان است.","Back":"بازگشت","Next":"بعدی","Your result":"نتیجه شما","Mechanisms that could receive this case":"سازوکارهایی که می‌توانند این پرونده را بپذیرند","This checker is a guide, not legal advice. Rules change and every mechanism has further conditions, so the Clinic will check the details before anything is filed. Treaty acceptance for Indonesia was last checked in October 2026; for other countries, see the":"این ابزار یک راهنماست، نه مشاوره حقوقی. قواعد تغییر می‌کنند و هر سازوکار شرایط دیگری هم دارد، پس کلینیک پیش از ارائه هر چیزی جزئیات را بررسی می‌کند. پذیرش معاهدات از سوی اندونزی آخرین بار در اکتبر ۲۰۲۶ بررسی شد؛ برای کشورهای دیگر ببینید:","OHCHR ratification dashboard":"داشبورد تصویب معاهدات دفتر کمیساریای عالی حقوق بشر","Draft the communication":"نوشتن شکایت","Fill in what you can. The page turns your answers into a draft communication in the form the chosen body expects. An IMR Clinic officer then reviews it with you before anything is filed. Nothing is sent to any international body from this page.":"هر چه می‌توانید پر کنید. این صفحه پاسخ‌های شما را به پیش‌نویس شکایتی در قالب مورد نیاز نهاد انتخاب‌شده تبدیل می‌کند. سپس یکی از کارکنان کلینیک پیش از ارائه، آن را با شما مرور می‌کند. از این صفحه چیزی برای هیچ نهاد بین‌المللی فرستاده نمی‌شود.","1. Where to send it":"۱. مقصد شکایت","Mechanism":"سازوکار","2. Author of the communication":"۲. شاکی","Full name":"نام کامل","Nationality":"ملیت","Date of birth":"تاریخ تولد","Safe contact: email, phone or WhatsApp":"راه تماس امن: ایمیل، تلفن یا واتس‌اپ","Are you the person affected?":"آیا شما خود فرد آسیب‌دیده هستید؟","Yes":"بله","No, I am acting for them":"خیر، از طرف او اقدام می‌کنم","3. The person affected":"۳. فرد آسیب‌دیده","Where they are now":"جایی که اکنون هست","Your relationship to them, and whether they have agreed":"نسبت شما با او و اینکه آیا موافقت کرده است","4. The State concerned":"۴. دولت مربوط","Country":"کشور","5. The facts":"۵. وقایع","What happened, in date order: who did what, when and where":"آنچه رخ داد به ترتیب تاریخ: چه کسی، چه کاری، کی و کجا","6. Rights violated":"۶. حقوق نقض‌شده","Suggested from your answers for the chosen mechanism. Untick any that do not fit; the officer will refine them.":"بر اساس پاسخ‌های شما برای سازوکار انتخاب‌شده پیشنهاد شده است. موارد نامربوط را بردارید؛ کارشناس آن‌ها را اصلاح می‌کند.","7. National remedies":"۷. راه‌های جبران داخلی","Courts or authorities approached, with dates and results":"دادگاه‌ها یا مقاماتی که به آن‌ها مراجعه شد، با تاریخ و نتیجه","If none were used, why not?":"اگر به هیچ‌کدام مراجعه نشد، چرا؟","8. Other international procedures":"۸. سایر رویه‌های بین‌المللی","Has this been sent anywhere else? Give the body, date and result.":"آیا این پرونده به جای دیگری فرستاده شده است؟ نام نهاد، تاریخ و نتیجه را بنویسید.","9. What you are asking for":"۹. خواسته شما","Remedy sought (for example release, compensation, halting a deportation, investigation)":"جبران خواسته‌شده (مثلاً آزادی، غرامت، توقف اخراج، تحقیق)","Ask for urgent interim measures because someone is at immediate risk":"درخواست اقدامات موقت فوری، چون کسی در خطر فوری است","10. Documents":"۱۰. مدارک","Documents you have (court decisions, medical reports, contracts, ID). Do not upload them here; the officer will ask for copies.":"مدارکی که دارید (احکام دادگاه، گزارش پزشکی، قرارداد، مدرک هویت). اینجا بارگذاری نکنید؛ کارشناس نسخه‌ها را درخواست می‌کند.","I agree that the Clinic may keep these details to assess the case, and will not share them without my permission.":"موافقم که کلینیک این اطلاعات را برای ارزیابی پرونده نگه دارد و بدون اجازه من آن را به کسی ندهد.","Preview the draft":"پیش‌نمایش پیش‌نویس","Send to an IMR officer":"ارسال برای کارشناس IMR","Draft communication":"پیش‌نویس شکایت","Download draft (.doc)":"دانلود پیش‌نویس (.doc)","Print":"چاپ","Start again":"شروع دوباره","For example: brother, with written consent":"مثلاً: برادر، با رضایت کتبی","Which government is responsible for what happened?":"کدام دولت مسئول آن چیزی است که رخ داد؟","Usually the country where it happened. If officials of one country acted abroad, choose that country.":"معمولاً کشوری که رویداد در آن رخ داده است. اگر مأموران یک کشور در خارج اقدام کرده‌اند، آن کشور را انتخاب کنید.","What happened? Choose all that apply.":"چه اتفاقی افتاد؟ همه موارد مربوط را انتخاب کنید.","Is someone at immediate risk?":"آیا کسی در خطر فوری است؟","For example, a deportation in the next days, serious illness in detention, or threats to life.":"مثلاً اخراج در چند روز آینده، بیماری جدی در بازداشت یا تهدید جانی.","What has happened in the national courts or authorities?":"در دادگاه‌ها یا نهادهای داخلی چه اتفاقی افتاده است؟","Most international bodies only hear a case after national remedies have been used.":"بیشتر نهادهای بین‌المللی فقط پس از استفاده از راه‌های جبران داخلی به پرونده رسیدگی می‌کنند.","When was the final national decision?":"آخرین تصمیم داخلی کی صادر شد؟","Has the same case already been sent to another international body?":"آیا همین پرونده به نهاد بین‌المللی دیگری فرستاده شده است؟","You can check on the OHCHR ratification dashboard (indicators.ohchr.org). If you are not sure, choose \"I don't know\" and the Clinic will check.":"می‌توانید در داشبورد تصویب (indicators.ohchr.org) بررسی کنید. اگر مطمئن نیستید، «نمی‌دانم» را انتخاب کنید تا کلینیک بررسی کند.","Who would bring the case?":"چه کسی پرونده را طرح می‌کند؟","Indonesia":"اندونزی","Another ASEAN country (for example Malaysia, Singapore, Thailand)":"کشور دیگری از آسه‌آن (مثلاً مالزی، سنگاپور، تایلند)","A Council of Europe country (most of Europe, including the EU and the UK)":"کشور عضو شورای اروپا (بیشتر اروپا، از جمله اتحادیه اروپا و بریتانیا)","A country in the Americas (OAS member)":"کشوری در قاره آمریکا (عضو سازمان کشورهای آمریکایی)","An African Union country":"کشور عضو اتحادیه آفریقا","A Gulf or Middle Eastern country":"کشوری در خلیج فارس یا خاورمیانه","Somewhere else":"جای دیگر","Torture, beatings or other ill-treatment":"شکنجه، ضرب‌وشتم یا دیگر بدرفتاری‌ها","Detention, including immigration detention":"بازداشت، از جمله بازداشت مهاجرتی","Deportation or return to a country where the person is in danger":"اخراج یا بازگرداندن به کشوری که فرد در آن در خطر است","Seeking asylum or refugee protection":"درخواست پناهندگی یا حمایت به‌عنوان پناهنده","Forced labor, trafficking or debt bondage":"کار اجباری، قاچاق انسان یا بردگی بدهی","Unpaid wages, unsafe work or other abuse at work":"دستمزد پرداخت‌نشده، کار ناایمن یا بدرفتاری دیگر در محل کار","Discrimination because of race, nationality or religion":"تبعیض به دلیل نژاد، تابعیت یا دین","Violence or discrimination against a woman or girl":"خشونت یا تبعیض علیه زن یا دختر","A child was affected":"کودکی آسیب دیده است","Freedom of expression, religion, family life or a fair trial":"آزادی بیان، دین، زندگی خانوادگی یا دادرسی منصفانه","Health care, housing or education":"خدمات درمانی، مسکن یا آموزش","No":"خیر","There is a final decision with no further appeal":"تصمیم نهایی صادر شده و راه اعتراض دیگری نیست","A case is still going on":"پرونده هنوز در جریان است","Nothing has been tried yet":"هنوز کاری انجام نشده است","It is not possible or not safe to use them, or they do not work":"استفاده از آن‌ها ممکن یا امن نیست، یا مؤثر نیستند","Less than 4 months ago":"کمتر از ۴ ماه پیش","4 to 6 months ago":"۴ تا ۶ ماه پیش","6 to 12 months ago":"۶ تا ۱۲ ماه پیش","1 to 5 years ago":"۱ تا ۵ سال پیش","More than 5 years ago":"بیش از ۵ سال پیش","Yes, and it is still being examined":"بله، و هنوز در حال بررسی است","Yes, and it has been decided":"بله، و درباره آن تصمیم گرفته شده است","Yes, for the relevant treaty":"بله، برای معاهده مربوط","The person affected":"خود فرد آسیب‌دیده","A relative or lawyer, with the person's consent":"یکی از بستگان یا وکیل، با رضایت فرد","An organization such as a trade union or NGO":"سازمانی مانند اتحادیه کارگری یا سازمان غیردولتی","I don't know":"نمی‌دانم","Question":"پرسش","of":"از","See the result":"دیدن نتیجه","Please choose an answer to continue.":"لطفاً برای ادامه یک پاسخ را انتخاب کنید.","Likely open":"احتمالاً باز است","Possible":"ممکن","Possible, needs checking":"ممکن، نیاز به بررسی","Not yet":"هنوز نه","Not available":"در دسترس نیست","Official page ↗":"صفحه رسمی ↗","Mechanisms that could take the case now: {n}. Others may open later or need checking.":"سازوکارهایی که اکنون می‌توانند پرونده را بپذیرند: {n}. بقیه ممکن است بعداً باز شوند یا نیاز به بررسی دارند.","The explanations below are in English. The Clinic can explain them in your language.":"توضیحات زیر به زبان انگلیسی است. کلینیک می‌تواند آن‌ها را به زبان شما توضیح دهد.","If someone is at immediate risk, contact the Clinic now":"اگر کسی در خطر فوری است، همین حالا با کلینیک تماس بگیرید","Translations have not yet been reviewed. If anything is unclear, the English version applies.":"ترجمه‌ها هنوز بازبینی نشده‌اند. اگر چیزی روشن نیست، نسخه انگلیسی ملاک است.","Language":"زبان","Free of charge":"رایگان","About 15 minutes":"حدود ۱۵ دقیقه","Reviewed by an IMR lawyer":"بررسی توسط وکیل IMR","Nothing is filed without your agreement":"هیچ چیزی بدون موافقت شما ارسال نمی‌شود","Check":"بررسی","Answer a few questions":"به چند پرسش پاسخ دهید","Choose":"انتخاب","See where the case can go":"ببینید پرونده به کجا می‌تواند برود","Draft and send":"نوشتن و ارسال","Write it, then send to IMR":"بنویسید، سپس برای IMR بفرستید","Need help filling this in? Call the Clinic on":"برای پر کردن کمک می‌خواهید؟ با کلینیک تماس بگیرید:","or email":"یا ایمیل","Where this case may go":"این پرونده ممکن است به کجا برود","Answer the first question to see a prediction.":"به پرسش اول پاسخ دهید تا پیش‌بینی را ببینید.","The prediction changes as you answer. It is a guide, not legal advice.":"پیش‌بینی با پاسخ‌های شما تغییر می‌کند. این یک راهنماست، نه مشاوره حقوقی.","Strong fit":"بسیار مناسب","Good fit":"مناسب","Show":"نمایش","Hide":"پنهان","Predicted fit":"میزان تناسب پیش‌بینی‌شده","Listen":"گوش دهید","Where this case could go":"این پرونده به کجا می‌تواند برود","Can take the case now":"اکنون می‌تواند پرونده را بپذیرد","May open later, or needs checking":"ممکن است بعداً باز شود، یا نیاز به بررسی دارد","Not available for this case":"برای این پرونده در دسترس نیست","Draft for this body →":"نوشتن برای این نهاد ←","Guides and model forms":"راهنماها و فرم‌های نمونه","Draft the communication →":"نوشتن شکایت ←","Where to send it, and who you are":"به کجا فرستاده شود، و شما چه کسی هستید","Choose the body for this draft. You can change it later.":"نهاد را برای این پیش‌نویس انتخاب کنید. بعداً می‌توانید آن را تغییر دهید.","About you":"درباره شما","(optional)":"(اختیاری)","The person affected and the State":"شخص آسیب‌دیده و دولت","Tell us about the person whose rights were violated.":"درباره کسی که حقوقش نقض شده بگویید.","The State concerned":"دولت مربوط","Country responsible":"کشور مسئول","What happened":"چه اتفاقی افتاد","Describe the events in date order, in your own words and in any language. The Clinic will help with the legal wording.":"رویدادها را به ترتیب تاریخ، با کلمات خودتان و به هر زبانی بنویسید. کلینیک در نوشتن حقوقی کمک می‌کند.","You can speak instead of writing.":"می‌توانید به جای نوشتن، صحبت کنید.","Press the red button and tell us what happened, in your own language. Up to 5 minutes.":"دکمه قرمز را فشار دهید و به زبان خودتان بگویید چه اتفاقی افتاد. حداکثر ۵ دقیقه.","Record my story":"ضبط داستان من","Stop recording":"توقف ضبط","Delete and record again":"حذف و ضبط دوباره","or write it":"یا بنویسید","The facts":"واقعیت‌ها","A strong account usually says:":"یک شرح خوب معمولاً می‌گوید:","who did what, when and where, with dates if you know them;":"چه کسی چه کاری کرد، کی و کجا، با تاریخ اگر می‌دانید؛","what officials did or failed to do;":"مأموران چه کردند یا چه نکردند؛","the harm caused, and what is happening now.":"چه آسیبی رسید، و اکنون چه می‌گذرد.","Rights and remedies":"حقوق و جبران","These rights are suggested from your answers for the body you chose. Untick any that do not fit; the officer will refine them.":"این حقوق بر اساس پاسخ‌های شما برای نهادی که انتخاب کردید پیشنهاد شده‌اند. هر کدام را که مناسب نیست بردارید؛ کارمند کلینیک آن‌ها را دقیق‌تر می‌کند.","National remedies":"راه‌های جبران داخلی","Other international procedures":"روندهای بین‌المللی دیگر","What you are asking for":"چه درخواستی دارید","Remedy sought":"جبران درخواستی","(for example release, compensation, halting a deportation, an investigation)":"(مثلاً آزادی، غرامت، توقف اخراج، تحقیق)","Documents":"مدارک","Documents you have":"مدارکی که دارید","(court decisions, medical reports, contracts, ID). Do not upload them here; the officer will ask for copies.":"(حکم دادگاه، گزارش پزشکی، قرارداد، کارت شناسایی). اینجا بارگذاری نکنید؛ کارمند کلینیک نسخه‌ها را از شما می‌خواهد.","Review and send":"بررسی و ارسال","Read the draft below. When you send it, it goes only to the IMR International Legal Clinic, not to any international body. An officer will contact you to review it.":"پیش‌نویس زیر را بخوانید. وقتی آن را بفرستید، فقط به کلینیک حقوقی بین‌المللی IMR می‌رسد، نه به هیچ نهاد بین‌المللی. یک کارمند برای بررسی با شما تماس می‌گیرد.","Your reference:":"شماره پیگیری شما:","Keep it in case you need to contact the Clinic.":"آن را نگه دارید تا اگر لازم شد با کلینیک تماس بگیرید.","How we handle your data: the form is stored by our web host, Netlify, whose servers are mostly in the United States, and is then read only by Clinic staff. If that is a risk for you, download the draft instead and send it to":"نحوه نگهداری اطلاعات شما: فرم نزد میزبان وب ما، Netlify، که سرورهایش بیشتر در ایالات متحده است، نگهداری می‌شود و سپس فقط کارکنان کلینیک آن را می‌خوانند. اگر این برای شما خطر دارد، پیش‌نویس را دانلود کنید و بفرستید به","or bring it to the Clinic.":"یا آن را به کلینیک بیاورید.","Download (.doc)":"دانلود (.doc)","Send to an IMR lawyer":"ارسال برای وکیل IMR","Step":"گام","← Back to results":"→ بازگشت به نتایج","Live preview":"پیش‌نمایش زنده","Sending…":"در حال ارسال…","The draft could not be sent just now.":"پیش‌نویس فعلاً ارسال نشد.","Microphone not allowed. Please write instead.":"اجازه استفاده از میکروفون داده نشد. لطفاً بنویسید.","Draft in your language":"پیش‌نویس به زبان شما","Draft in English":"پیش‌نویس به انگلیسی","DRAFT FOR REVIEW BY THE IMR INTERNATIONAL LEGAL CLINIC. NOT YET SUBMITTED.":"پیش‌نویس برای بررسی کلینیک حقوقی بین‌المللی IMR. هنوز ارسال نشده است.","To":"به","Type":"نوع","Date":"تاریخ","IMR reference":"شماره پیگیری IMR","INFORMATION ON THE AUTHOR":"اطلاعات نویسنده شکایت","Name":"نام","Address for correspondence":"نشانی مکاتبه","to be completed with the Clinic":"با کلینیک تکمیل می‌شود","INFORMATION ON THE ALLEGED VICTIM":"اطلاعات قربانی ادعایی","The author is the alleged victim.":"نویسنده خود قربانی است.","Present location":"محل فعلی","Authority to act":"اجازه اقدام","written consent of the victim to be attached":"رضایت کتبی قربانی پیوست می‌شود","STATE CONCERNED":"دولت مربوط","FACTS OF THE CASE":"واقعیت‌های پرونده","RIGHTS ALLEGED TO HAVE BEEN VIOLATED":"حقوقی که ادعا می‌شود نقض شده‌اند","to be identified":"مشخص می‌شود","EXHAUSTION OF DOMESTIC REMEDIES":"استفاده از راه‌های جبران داخلی","Remedies unavailable or ineffective because":"راه‌های جبران در دسترس یا مؤثر نبودند زیرا","OTHER INTERNATIONAL PROCEDURES":"روندهای بین‌المللی دیگر","REMEDY SOUGHT":"جبران درخواستی","Request for interim measures":"درخواست اقدامات موقت","the author asks that the State be requested to take interim measures to avoid irreparable harm to the alleged victim while the communication is under consideration.":"نویسنده درخواست می‌کند از دولت خواسته شود تا زمانی که شکایت بررسی می‌شود، برای جلوگیری از آسیب جبران‌ناپذیر به قربانی اقدامات موقت انجام دهد.","SUPPORTING DOCUMENTS":"مدارک پشتیبان","to be listed":"فهرست می‌شود","Signature":"امضا","not yet given":"هنوز داده نشده","The same matter has not been submitted to any other procedure of international investigation or settlement.":"همین موضوع به هیچ روند دیگر تحقیق یا حل‌وفصل بین‌المللی ارسال نشده است.","Told in a voice message, attached. The Clinic will transcribe it.":"در یک پیام صوتی گفته شده، پیوست است. کلینیک آن را می‌نویسد.","A voice message is also attached.":"یک پیام صوتی نیز پیوست است.","Draft for IMR review · not yet submitted":"پیش‌نویس برای بررسی IMR · هنوز ارسال نشده","Easy mode: big pictures, questions read aloud":"حالت آسان: تصاویر بزرگ، سؤال‌ها با صدای بلند خوانده می‌شوند","Recruiting agency and employer":"آژانس استخدام و کارفرما","(if any)":"(در صورت وجود)","Recruiting agency or agent":"آژانس استخدام یا واسطه","Name of the company or person who arranged the job":"نام شرکت یا شخصی که کار را ترتیب داد","Employer":"کارفرما","Name of the employer, farm or household":"نام کارفرما، مزرعه یا خانواده","Which country?":"کدام کشور؟","I'm not sure":"مطمئن نیستم","Choose a country":"یک کشور انتخاب کنید","Has that country accepted individual communications to UN treaty committees?":"آیا آن کشور مراسلات فردی به کمیته‌های معاهدات سازمان ملل را پذیرفته است؟","Find out which international bodies can hear your case. Then draft your rights communication step by step, and an IMR lawyer reviews it with you before anything is filed.":"ببینید کدام نهادهای بین‌المللی می‌توانند به پرونده شما رسیدگی کنند. سپس مراسله حقوقی خود را گام به گام بنویسید و یک وکیل IMR پیش از ارسال هر چیزی آن را با شما بررسی می‌کند.","This lets us check which UN communication procedures that country has accepted.":"این به ما کمک می‌کند ببینیم آن کشور کدام روندهای مراسلات سازمان ملل را پذیرفته است.","Before anything is filed, the person affected must sign an authorization letting you, or IMR, act for them. If they cannot sign, for example because they are detained, the Clinic officer will explain what can be done instead.":"پیش از ارسال هر چیزی، فرد آسیب‌دیده باید وکالت‌نامه‌ای امضا کند که به شما، یا IMR، اجازه دهد از طرف او اقدام کنید. اگر نتواند امضا کند، مثلاً چون بازداشت است، کارمند کلینیک توضیح می‌دهد چه کار دیگری می‌توان کرد."},"bn":{"International Legal Clinic":"আন্তর্জাতিক আইনি ক্লিনিক","Prepare a human rights communication":"মানবাধিকার বিষয়ক অভিযোগপত্র তৈরি করুন","Answer a few questions about what happened. At the end you will see which international human rights mechanisms could receive the case, which cannot, and why. Then a guided form helps you draft the communication itself, which an IMR Clinic officer reviews before the next stage. There is no charge.":"কী ঘটেছে সে বিষয়ে কয়েকটি প্রশ্নের উত্তর দিন। শেষে আপনি দেখবেন কোন আন্তর্জাতিক মানবাধিকার ব্যবস্থা মামলাটি গ্রহণ করতে পারে, কোনটি পারে না, এবং কেন। তারপর একটি নির্দেশিত ফর্ম আপনাকে অভিযোগপত্রটি লিখতে সাহায্য করবে, যা পরবর্তী ধাপের আগে IMR ক্লিনিকের একজন কর্মকর্তা পর্যালোচনা করবেন। কোনো খরচ নেই।","Back":"পেছনে","Next":"পরবর্তী","Your result":"আপনার ফলাফল","Mechanisms that could receive this case":"যেসব ব্যবস্থা এই মামলা গ্রহণ করতে পারে","This checker is a guide, not legal advice. Rules change and every mechanism has further conditions, so the Clinic will check the details before anything is filed. Treaty acceptance for Indonesia was last checked in October 2026; for other countries, see the":"এটি একটি নির্দেশিকা, আইনি পরামর্শ নয়। নিয়ম বদলায় এবং প্রতিটি ব্যবস্থার আরও শর্ত আছে, তাই কিছু জমা দেওয়ার আগে ক্লিনিক বিস্তারিত যাচাই করবে। ইন্দোনেশিয়ার চুক্তি গ্রহণের তথ্য সর্বশেষ অক্টোবর ২০২৬-এ যাচাই করা হয়েছে; অন্য দেশের জন্য দেখুন","OHCHR ratification dashboard":"OHCHR অনুসমর্থন ড্যাশবোর্ড","Draft the communication":"অভিযোগপত্র লিখুন","Fill in what you can. The page turns your answers into a draft communication in the form the chosen body expects. An IMR Clinic officer then reviews it with you before anything is filed. Nothing is sent to any international body from this page.":"যা পারেন পূরণ করুন। এই পৃষ্ঠা আপনার উত্তরগুলোকে নির্বাচিত সংস্থার চাওয়া আকারে একটি খসড়া অভিযোগপত্রে রূপ দেয়। কিছু জমা দেওয়ার আগে IMR ক্লিনিকের একজন কর্মকর্তা আপনার সঙ্গে এটি পর্যালোচনা করবেন। এই পৃষ্ঠা থেকে কোনো আন্তর্জাতিক সংস্থায় কিছু পাঠানো হয় না।","1. Where to send it":"১. কোথায় পাঠানো হবে","Mechanism":"ব্যবস্থা","2. Author of the communication":"২. অভিযোগকারী","Full name":"পূর্ণ নাম","Nationality":"জাতীয়তা","Date of birth":"জন্ম তারিখ","Safe contact: email, phone or WhatsApp":"নিরাপদ যোগাযোগ: ইমেইল, ফোন বা হোয়াটসঅ্যাপ","Are you the person affected?":"আপনি কি ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত ব্যক্তি?","Yes":"হ্যাঁ","No, I am acting for them":"না, আমি তার পক্ষে কাজ করছি","3. The person affected":"৩. ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত ব্যক্তি","Where they are now":"তিনি এখন কোথায় আছেন","Your relationship to them, and whether they have agreed":"তার সঙ্গে আপনার সম্পর্ক, এবং তিনি সম্মতি দিয়েছেন কি না","4. The State concerned":"৪. সংশ্লিষ্ট রাষ্ট্র","Country":"দেশ","5. The facts":"৫. ঘটনাবলি","What happened, in date order: who did what, when and where":"তারিখ অনুযায়ী কী ঘটেছে: কে কী করেছে, কখন এবং কোথায়","6. Rights violated":"৬. লঙ্ঘিত অধিকার","Suggested from your answers for the chosen mechanism. Untick any that do not fit; the officer will refine them.":"নির্বাচিত ব্যবস্থার জন্য আপনার উত্তর থেকে প্রস্তাবিত। যা মেলে না তার টিক তুলে দিন; কর্মকর্তা সেগুলো ঠিক করবেন।","7. National remedies":"৭. দেশীয় প্রতিকার","Courts or authorities approached, with dates and results":"যেসব আদালত বা কর্তৃপক্ষের কাছে গিয়েছেন, তারিখ ও ফলাফলসহ","If none were used, why not?":"যদি কোথাও না গিয়ে থাকেন, কেন?","8. Other international procedures":"৮. অন্যান্য আন্তর্জাতিক প্রক্রিয়া","Has this been sent anywhere else? Give the body, date and result.":"এটি কি অন্য কোথাও পাঠানো হয়েছে? সংস্থা, তারিখ ও ফলাফল লিখুন।","9. What you are asking for":"৯. আপনি কী চান","Remedy sought (for example release, compensation, halting a deportation, investigation)":"প্রত্যাশিত প্রতিকার (যেমন মুক্তি, ক্ষতিপূরণ, নির্বাসন বন্ধ, তদন্ত)","Ask for urgent interim measures because someone is at immediate risk":"কেউ তাৎক্ষণিক বিপদে আছেন বলে জরুরি অন্তর্বর্তী ব্যবস্থার অনুরোধ করুন","10. Documents":"১০. কাগজপত্র","Documents you have (court decisions, medical reports, contracts, ID). Do not upload them here; the officer will ask for copies.":"আপনার কাছে থাকা কাগজপত্র (আদালতের রায়, মেডিকেল রিপোর্ট, চুক্তি, পরিচয়পত্র)। এখানে আপলোড করবেন না; কর্মকর্তা কপি চাইবেন।","I agree that the Clinic may keep these details to assess the case, and will not share them without my permission.":"আমি সম্মত যে ক্লিনিক মামলাটি মূল্যায়নের জন্য এই তথ্য রাখতে পারবে, এবং আমার অনুমতি ছাড়া কারও সঙ্গে শেয়ার করবে না।","Preview the draft":"খসড়া দেখুন","Send to an IMR officer":"IMR কর্মকর্তার কাছে পাঠান","Draft communication":"খসড়া অভিযোগপত্র","Download draft (.doc)":"খসড়া ডাউনলোড (.doc)","Print":"প্রিন্ট","Start again":"আবার শুরু করুন","For example: brother, with written consent":"উদাহরণ: ভাই, লিখিত সম্মতিসহ","Which government is responsible for what happened?":"যা ঘটেছে তার জন্য কোন সরকার দায়ী?","Usually the country where it happened. If officials of one country acted abroad, choose that country.":"সাধারণত যে দেশে ঘটনা ঘটেছে। যদি কোনো দেশের কর্মকর্তারা বিদেশে কাজ করে থাকেন, সেই দেশটি বেছে নিন।","What happened? Choose all that apply.":"কী ঘটেছে? যা যা প্রযোজ্য সব বেছে নিন।","Is someone at immediate risk?":"কেউ কি তাৎক্ষণিক বিপদে আছেন?","For example, a deportation in the next days, serious illness in detention, or threats to life.":"যেমন কয়েক দিনের মধ্যে নির্বাসন, আটক অবস্থায় গুরুতর অসুস্থতা, বা জীবনের হুমকি।","What has happened in the national courts or authorities?":"দেশের আদালত বা কর্তৃপক্ষের কাছে কী হয়েছে?","Most international bodies only hear a case after national remedies have been used.":"বেশিরভাগ আন্তর্জাতিক সংস্থা দেশীয় প্রতিকার ব্যবহারের পরেই মামলা শোনে।","When was the final national decision?":"দেশের চূড়ান্ত সিদ্ধান্ত কবে হয়েছিল?","Has the same case already been sent to another international body?":"একই মামলা কি অন্য কোনো আন্তর্জাতিক সংস্থায় পাঠানো হয়েছে?","You can check on the OHCHR ratification dashboard (indicators.ohchr.org). If you are not sure, choose \"I don't know\" and the Clinic will check.":"আপনি OHCHR অনুসমর্থন ড্যাশবোর্ডে (indicators.ohchr.org) দেখতে পারেন। নিশ্চিত না হলে \"আমি জানি না\" বেছে নিন, ক্লিনিক যাচাই করবে।","Who would bring the case?":"মামলাটি কে করবেন?","Indonesia":"ইন্দোনেশিয়া","Another ASEAN country (for example Malaysia, Singapore, Thailand)":"আসিয়ানের অন্য কোনো দেশ (যেমন মালয়েশিয়া, সিঙ্গাপুর, থাইল্যান্ড)","A Council of Europe country (most of Europe, including the EU and the UK)":"কাউন্সিল অব ইউরোপের কোনো দেশ (ইউরোপের বেশিরভাগ, ইইউ ও যুক্তরাজ্যসহ)","A country in the Americas (OAS member)":"আমেরিকা মহাদেশের কোনো দেশ (OAS সদস্য)","An African Union country":"আফ্রিকান ইউনিয়নের কোনো দেশ","A Gulf or Middle Eastern country":"উপসাগরীয় বা মধ্যপ্রাচ্যের কোনো দেশ","Somewhere else":"অন্য কোথাও","Torture, beatings or other ill-treatment":"নির্যাতন, মারধর বা অন্য দুর্ব্যবহার","Detention, including immigration detention":"আটক, অভিবাসন আটকসহ","Deportation or return to a country where the person is in danger":"নির্বাসন বা এমন দেশে ফেরত পাঠানো যেখানে ব্যক্তি বিপদে","Seeking asylum or refugee protection":"আশ্রয় বা শরণার্থী সুরক্ষা চাওয়া","Forced labor, trafficking or debt bondage":"জোরপূর্বক শ্রম, মানব পাচার বা ঋণদাসত্ব","Unpaid wages, unsafe work or other abuse at work":"অপরিশোধিত মজুরি, অনিরাপদ কাজ বা কর্মস্থলে অন্য নির্যাতন","Discrimination because of race, nationality or religion":"জাতি, জাতীয়তা বা ধর্মের কারণে বৈষম্য","Violence or discrimination against a woman or girl":"কোনো নারী বা মেয়ের বিরুদ্ধে সহিংসতা বা বৈষম্য","A child was affected":"একটি শিশু ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয়েছে","Freedom of expression, religion, family life or a fair trial":"মতপ্রকাশ, ধর্ম, পারিবারিক জীবন বা ন্যায্য বিচারের স্বাধীনতা","Health care, housing or education":"স্বাস্থ্যসেবা, আবাসন বা শিক্ষা","No":"না","There is a final decision with no further appeal":"চূড়ান্ত সিদ্ধান্ত হয়েছে, আর আপিলের সুযোগ নেই","A case is still going on":"মামলা এখনও চলছে","Nothing has been tried yet":"এখনও কিছু করা হয়নি","It is not possible or not safe to use them, or they do not work":"ব্যবহার করা সম্ভব বা নিরাপদ নয়, অথবা কার্যকর নয়","Less than 4 months ago":"৪ মাসের কম আগে","4 to 6 months ago":"৪ থেকে ৬ মাস আগে","6 to 12 months ago":"৬ থেকে ১২ মাস আগে","1 to 5 years ago":"১ থেকে ৫ বছর আগে","More than 5 years ago":"৫ বছরের বেশি আগে","Yes, and it is still being examined":"হ্যাঁ, এবং এখনও পরীক্ষাধীন","Yes, and it has been decided":"হ্যাঁ, এবং সিদ্ধান্ত হয়ে গেছে","Yes, for the relevant treaty":"হ্যাঁ, সংশ্লিষ্ট চুক্তির জন্য","The person affected":"ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত ব্যক্তি","A relative or lawyer, with the person's consent":"আত্মীয় বা আইনজীবী, ব্যক্তির সম্মতিসহ","An organization such as a trade union or NGO":"শ্রমিক ইউনিয়ন বা এনজিওর মতো কোনো সংগঠন","I don't know":"আমি জানি না","Question":"প্রশ্ন","of":"এর মধ্যে","See the result":"ফলাফল দেখুন","Please choose an answer to continue.":"এগিয়ে যেতে একটি উত্তর বেছে নিন।","Likely open":"সম্ভবত খোলা","Possible":"সম্ভব","Possible, needs checking":"সম্ভব, যাচাই প্রয়োজন","Not yet":"এখনও নয়","Not available":"প্রযোজ্য নয়","Official page ↗":"অফিসিয়াল পৃষ্ঠা ↗","Mechanisms that could take the case now: {n}. Others may open later or need checking.":"যেসব ব্যবস্থা এখনই মামলা গ্রহণ করতে পারে: {n}। অন্যগুলো পরে খুলতে পারে বা যাচাই প্রয়োজন।","The explanations below are in English. The Clinic can explain them in your language.":"নিচের ব্যাখ্যাগুলো ইংরেজিতে। ক্লিনিক আপনার ভাষায় সেগুলো বুঝিয়ে দিতে পারে।","If someone is at immediate risk, contact the Clinic now":"কেউ তাৎক্ষণিক বিপদে থাকলে এখনই ক্লিনিকে যোগাযোগ করুন","Translations have not yet been reviewed. If anything is unclear, the English version applies.":"অনুবাদগুলো এখনও পর্যালোচনা করা হয়নি। কিছু অস্পষ্ট হলে ইংরেজি সংস্করণই প্রযোজ্য।","Language":"ভাষা","Free of charge":"বিনামূল্যে","About 15 minutes":"প্রায় ১৫ মিনিট","Reviewed by an IMR lawyer":"IMR-এর আইনজীবী পর্যালোচনা করবেন","Nothing is filed without your agreement":"আপনার সম্মতি ছাড়া কিছুই দাখিল করা হবে না","Check":"যাচাই","Answer a few questions":"কয়েকটি প্রশ্নের উত্তর দিন","Choose":"বাছাই","See where the case can go":"মামলা কোথায় যেতে পারে দেখুন","Draft and send":"লিখুন ও পাঠান","Write it, then send to IMR":"লিখুন, তারপর IMR-কে পাঠান","Need help filling this in? Call the Clinic on":"এটি পূরণে সাহায্য দরকার? ক্লিনিকে ফোন করুন","or email":"অথবা ইমেল করুন","Where this case may go":"এই মামলা কোথায় যেতে পারে","Answer the first question to see a prediction.":"পূর্বাভাস দেখতে প্রথম প্রশ্নের উত্তর দিন।","The prediction changes as you answer. It is a guide, not legal advice.":"আপনি উত্তর দিতে থাকলে পূর্বাভাস বদলায়। এটি নির্দেশিকা, আইনি পরামর্শ নয়।","Strong fit":"খুব মানানসই","Good fit":"ভালো মানানসই","Show":"দেখান","Hide":"লুকান","Predicted fit":"পূর্বাভাসিত মিল","Listen":"শুনুন","Where this case could go":"এই মামলা কোথায় যেতে পারে","Can take the case now":"এখনই মামলা নিতে পারে","May open later, or needs checking":"পরে খুলতে পারে, বা যাচাই দরকার","Not available for this case":"এই মামলার জন্য প্রযোজ্য নয়","Draft for this body →":"এই সংস্থার জন্য খসড়া →","Guides and model forms":"নির্দেশিকা ও নমুনা ফর্ম","Draft the communication →":"অভিযোগের খসড়া লিখুন →","Where to send it, and who you are":"কোথায় পাঠাবেন, এবং আপনি কে","Choose the body for this draft. You can change it later.":"এই খসড়ার জন্য সংস্থা বাছাই করুন। পরে বদলাতে পারবেন।","About you":"আপনার সম্পর্কে","(optional)":"(ঐচ্ছিক)","The person affected and the State":"ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত ব্যক্তি ও রাষ্ট্র","Tell us about the person whose rights were violated.":"যাঁর অধিকার লঙ্ঘিত হয়েছে, তাঁর সম্পর্কে বলুন।","The State concerned":"সংশ্লিষ্ট রাষ্ট্র","Country responsible":"দায়ী দেশ","What happened":"কী ঘটেছিল","Describe the events in date order, in your own words and in any language. The Clinic will help with the legal wording.":"তারিখের ক্রমে ঘটনাগুলো নিজের ভাষায়, যেকোনো ভাষায় বর্ণনা করুন। আইনি ভাষায় ক্লিনিক সাহায্য করবে।","You can speak instead of writing.":"লেখার বদলে বলতেও পারেন।","Press the red button and tell us what happened, in your own language. Up to 5 minutes.":"লাল বোতাম চাপুন এবং নিজের ভাষায় বলুন কী ঘটেছিল। সর্বোচ্চ ৫ মিনিট।","Record my story":"আমার কথা রেকর্ড করুন","Stop recording":"রেকর্ডিং বন্ধ করুন","Delete and record again":"মুছে আবার রেকর্ড করুন","or write it":"অথবা লিখুন","The facts":"ঘটনাসমূহ","A strong account usually says:":"একটি ভালো বিবরণে সাধারণত থাকে:","who did what, when and where, with dates if you know them;":"কে কী করেছে, কখন ও কোথায়, জানা থাকলে তারিখসহ;","what officials did or failed to do;":"কর্মকর্তারা কী করেছেন বা করেননি;","the harm caused, and what is happening now.":"কী ক্ষতি হয়েছে, এবং এখন কী ঘটছে।","Rights and remedies":"অধিকার ও প্রতিকার","These rights are suggested from your answers for the body you chose. Untick any that do not fit; the officer will refine them.":"আপনার বাছাই করা সংস্থার জন্য আপনার উত্তর থেকে এই অধিকারগুলো প্রস্তাব করা হয়েছে। যেগুলো খাটে না সেগুলোর টিক তুলে দিন; কর্মকর্তা পরে ঠিক করবেন।","National remedies":"দেশীয় প্রতিকার","Other international procedures":"অন্যান্য আন্তর্জাতিক প্রক্রিয়া","What you are asking for":"আপনি কী চাইছেন","Remedy sought":"প্রার্থিত প্রতিকার","(for example release, compensation, halting a deportation, an investigation)":"(যেমন মুক্তি, ক্ষতিপূরণ, নির্বাসন বন্ধ, তদন্ত)","Documents":"নথিপত্র","Documents you have":"আপনার কাছে থাকা নথি","(court decisions, medical reports, contracts, ID). Do not upload them here; the officer will ask for copies.":"(আদালতের রায়, চিকিৎসা প্রতিবেদন, চুক্তি, পরিচয়পত্র)। এখানে আপলোড করবেন না; কর্মকর্তা কপি চাইবেন।","Review and send":"দেখে নিন ও পাঠান","Read the draft below. When you send it, it goes only to the IMR International Legal Clinic, not to any international body. An officer will contact you to review it.":"নিচের খসড়াটি পড়ুন। পাঠালে এটি শুধু IMR আন্তর্জাতিক আইনি ক্লিনিকে যাবে, কোনো আন্তর্জাতিক সংস্থায় নয়। একজন কর্মকর্তা পর্যালোচনার জন্য আপনার সঙ্গে যোগাযোগ করবেন।","Your reference:":"আপনার রেফারেন্স:","Keep it in case you need to contact the Clinic.":"ক্লিনিকের সঙ্গে যোগাযোগের দরকার হলে এটি রেখে দিন।","How we handle your data: the form is stored by our web host, Netlify, whose servers are mostly in the United States, and is then read only by Clinic staff. If that is a risk for you, download the draft instead and send it to":"আমরা আপনার তথ্য কীভাবে রাখি: ফর্মটি আমাদের ওয়েব হোস্ট Netlify সংরক্ষণ করে, যার সার্ভার বেশিরভাগ যুক্তরাষ্ট্রে, এবং তারপর শুধু ক্লিনিকের কর্মীরা তা পড়েন। এটি আপনার জন্য ঝুঁকিপূর্ণ হলে খসড়াটি ডাউনলোড করে পাঠান","or bring it to the Clinic.":"অথবা ক্লিনিকে নিয়ে আসুন।","Download (.doc)":"ডাউনলোড (.doc)","Send to an IMR lawyer":"IMR-এর আইনজীবীকে পাঠান","Step":"ধাপ","← Back to results":"← ফলাফলে ফিরে যান","Live preview":"সরাসরি প্রিভিউ","Sending…":"পাঠানো হচ্ছে…","The draft could not be sent just now.":"এই মুহূর্তে খসড়াটি পাঠানো গেল না।","Microphone not allowed. Please write instead.":"মাইক্রোফোনের অনুমতি নেই। অনুগ্রহ করে লিখুন।","Draft in your language":"আপনার ভাষায় খসড়া","Draft in English":"ইংরেজিতে খসড়া","DRAFT FOR REVIEW BY THE IMR INTERNATIONAL LEGAL CLINIC. NOT YET SUBMITTED.":"IMR আন্তর্জাতিক আইনি ক্লিনিকের পর্যালোচনার জন্য খসড়া। এখনো দাখিল করা হয়নি।","To":"প্রাপক","Type":"ধরন","Date":"তারিখ","IMR reference":"IMR রেফারেন্স","INFORMATION ON THE AUTHOR":"লেখকের তথ্য","Name":"নাম","Address for correspondence":"যোগাযোগের ঠিকানা","to be completed with the Clinic":"ক্লিনিকের সঙ্গে পূরণ করা হবে","INFORMATION ON THE ALLEGED VICTIM":"কথিত ভুক্তভোগীর তথ্য","The author is the alleged victim.":"লেখক নিজেই কথিত ভুক্তভোগী।","Present location":"বর্তমান অবস্থান","Authority to act":"পক্ষে কাজ করার অনুমতি","written consent of the victim to be attached":"ভুক্তভোগীর লিখিত সম্মতি সংযুক্ত করা হবে","STATE CONCERNED":"সংশ্লিষ্ট রাষ্ট্র","FACTS OF THE CASE":"মামলার ঘটনাসমূহ","RIGHTS ALLEGED TO HAVE BEEN VIOLATED":"লঙ্ঘিত বলে দাবি করা অধিকার","to be identified":"চিহ্নিত করা হবে","EXHAUSTION OF DOMESTIC REMEDIES":"দেশীয় প্রতিকার ব্যবহার","Remedies unavailable or ineffective because":"প্রতিকার পাওয়া যায়নি বা কার্যকর নয়, কারণ","OTHER INTERNATIONAL PROCEDURES":"অন্যান্য আন্তর্জাতিক প্রক্রিয়া","REMEDY SOUGHT":"প্রার্থিত প্রতিকার","Request for interim measures":"অন্তর্বর্তী ব্যবস্থার অনুরোধ","the author asks that the State be requested to take interim measures to avoid irreparable harm to the alleged victim while the communication is under consideration.":"অভিযোগটি বিবেচনাধীন থাকা অবস্থায় কথিত ভুক্তভোগীর অপূরণীয় ক্ষতি এড়াতে রাষ্ট্রকে অন্তর্বর্তী ব্যবস্থা নিতে অনুরোধ করার জন্য লেখক আবেদন করছেন।","SUPPORTING DOCUMENTS":"সহায়ক নথি","to be listed":"তালিকা করা হবে","Signature":"স্বাক্ষর","not yet given":"এখনো দেওয়া হয়নি","The same matter has not been submitted to any other procedure of international investigation or settlement.":"একই বিষয় আন্তর্জাতিক তদন্ত বা নিষ্পত্তির অন্য কোনো প্রক্রিয়ায় জমা দেওয়া হয়নি।","Told in a voice message, attached. The Clinic will transcribe it.":"ভয়েস মেসেজে বলা হয়েছে, সংযুক্ত। ক্লিনিক এটি লিখিত রূপে লিখে নেবে।","A voice message is also attached.":"একটি ভয়েস মেসেজও সংযুক্ত আছে।","Draft for IMR review · not yet submitted":"IMR পর্যালোচনার জন্য খসড়া · এখনো জমা দেওয়া হয়নি","Easy mode: big pictures, questions read aloud":"সহজ মোড: বড় ছবি, প্রশ্ন জোরে পড়ে শোনানো হয়","Recruiting agency and employer":"নিয়োগ সংস্থা ও নিয়োগকর্তা","(if any)":"(যদি থাকে)","Recruiting agency or agent":"নিয়োগ সংস্থা বা দালাল","Name of the company or person who arranged the job":"যে প্রতিষ্ঠান বা ব্যক্তি কাজের ব্যবস্থা করেছেন তাঁর নাম","Employer":"নিয়োগকর্তা","Name of the employer, farm or household":"নিয়োগকর্তা, খামার বা পরিবারের নাম","Which country?":"কোন দেশ?","I'm not sure":"আমি নিশ্চিত নই","Choose a country":"একটি দেশ বাছুন","Has that country accepted individual communications to UN treaty committees?":"সেই দেশ কি জাতিসংঘের চুক্তি কমিটিতে ব্যক্তিগত যোগাযোগপত্র (কমিউনিকেশন) গ্রহণ করে?","Find out which international bodies can hear your case. Then draft your rights communication step by step, and an IMR lawyer reviews it with you before anything is filed.":"কোন আন্তর্জাতিক সংস্থা আপনার মামলা শুনতে পারে তা জানুন। তারপর ধাপে ধাপে আপনার অধিকার-বিষয়ক যোগাযোগপত্র লিখুন; কিছু দাখিল করার আগে IMR-এর একজন আইনজীবী আপনার সঙ্গে তা পর্যালোচনা করবেন।","This lets us check which UN communication procedures that country has accepted.":"এতে আমরা দেখতে পারি দেশটি জাতিসংঘের কোন যোগাযোগপত্র প্রক্রিয়াগুলো মেনে নিয়েছে।","Before anything is filed, the person affected must sign an authorization letting you, or IMR, act for them. If they cannot sign, for example because they are detained, the Clinic officer will explain what can be done instead.":"কিছু দাখিল করার আগে, ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত ব্যক্তিকে একটি অনুমতিপত্রে সই করতে হবে, যাতে আপনি বা IMR তাঁর পক্ষে কাজ করতে পারেন। তিনি সই করতে না পারলে, যেমন আটক থাকলে, ক্লিনিকের কর্মকর্তা বুঝিয়ে দেবেন এর বদলে কী করা যায়।"},"ne":{"International Legal Clinic":"अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय कानूनी क्लिनिक","Prepare a human rights communication":"मानव अधिकारसम्बन्धी उजुरी तयार गर्नुहोस्","Answer a few questions about what happened. At the end you will see which international human rights mechanisms could receive the case, which cannot, and why. Then a guided form helps you draft the communication itself, which an IMR Clinic officer reviews before the next stage. There is no charge.":"के भयो भन्ने बारेमा केही प्रश्नको उत्तर दिनुहोस्। अन्त्यमा कुन अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय मानव अधिकार संयन्त्रले मुद्दा लिन सक्छ, कुनले सक्दैन र किन भन्ने देख्नुहुनेछ। त्यसपछि एउटा निर्देशित फारमले उजुरी लेख्न मद्दत गर्छ, जसलाई अर्को चरणअघि IMR क्लिनिकका अधिकारीले जाँच्नेछन्। कुनै शुल्क लाग्दैन।","Back":"पछाडि","Next":"अर्को","Your result":"तपाईंको नतिजा","Mechanisms that could receive this case":"यो मुद्दा लिन सक्ने संयन्त्रहरू","This checker is a guide, not legal advice. Rules change and every mechanism has further conditions, so the Clinic will check the details before anything is filed. Treaty acceptance for Indonesia was last checked in October 2026; for other countries, see the":"यो मार्गदर्शन हो, कानूनी सल्लाह होइन। नियम बदलिन्छन् र हरेक संयन्त्रका थप सर्तहरू हुन्छन्, त्यसैले केही पेस गर्नुअघि क्लिनिकले विवरण जाँच्नेछ। इन्डोनेसियाले सन्धि स्वीकार गरेको जानकारी अन्तिम पटक अक्टोबर २०२६ मा जाँचिएको थियो; अरू देशका लागि हेर्नुहोस्","OHCHR ratification dashboard":"OHCHR अनुमोदन ड्यासबोर्ड","Draft the communication":"उजुरी लेख्नुहोस्","Fill in what you can. The page turns your answers into a draft communication in the form the chosen body expects. An IMR Clinic officer then reviews it with you before anything is filed. Nothing is sent to any international body from this page.":"सकेजति भर्नुहोस्। यो पृष्ठले तपाईंका उत्तरलाई छानिएको निकायले माग्ने ढाँचामा उजुरीको मस्यौदा बनाउँछ। केही पेस गर्नुअघि IMR क्लिनिकका अधिकारीले तपाईंसँग यसलाई हेर्नेछन्। यस पृष्ठबाट कुनै अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय निकायमा केही पठाइँदैन।","1. Where to send it":"१. कहाँ पठाउने","Mechanism":"संयन्त्र","2. Author of the communication":"२. उजुरीकर्ता","Full name":"पूरा नाम","Nationality":"राष्ट्रियता","Date of birth":"जन्म मिति","Safe contact: email, phone or WhatsApp":"सुरक्षित सम्पर्क: इमेल, फोन वा ह्वाट्सएप","Are you the person affected?":"के तपाईं नै पीडित व्यक्ति हो?","Yes":"हो","No, I am acting for them":"होइन, म उहाँको तर्फबाट काम गर्दैछु","3. The person affected":"३. पीडित व्यक्ति","Where they are now":"उहाँ अहिले कहाँ हुनुहुन्छ","Your relationship to them, and whether they have agreed":"उहाँसँग तपाईंको नाता, र उहाँले सहमति दिनुभएको छ कि छैन","4. The State concerned":"४. सम्बन्धित राज्य","Country":"देश","5. The facts":"५. घटनाहरू","What happened, in date order: who did what, when and where":"मितिक्रम अनुसार के भयो: कसले के गर्‍यो, कहिले र कहाँ","6. Rights violated":"६. उल्लङ्घन भएका अधिकार","Suggested from your answers for the chosen mechanism. Untick any that do not fit; the officer will refine them.":"छानिएको संयन्त्रका लागि तपाईंका उत्तरबाट सुझाइएको। नमिल्नेमा चिन्ह हटाउनुहोस्; अधिकारीले सुधार गर्नेछन्।","7. National remedies":"७. राष्ट्रिय उपचार","Courts or authorities approached, with dates and results":"पुगेका अदालत वा निकायहरू, मिति र नतिजासहित","If none were used, why not?":"कतै नगएको भए, किन?","8. Other international procedures":"८. अन्य अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय प्रक्रिया","Has this been sent anywhere else? Give the body, date and result.":"के यो अरू कतै पठाइएको छ? निकाय, मिति र नतिजा लेख्नुहोस्।","9. What you are asking for":"९. तपाईं के माग्नुहुन्छ","Remedy sought (for example release, compensation, halting a deportation, investigation)":"माग गरिएको उपचार (जस्तै रिहाइ, क्षतिपूर्ति, देश निकाला रोक्ने, अनुसन्धान)","Ask for urgent interim measures because someone is at immediate risk":"कोही तत्काल खतरामा भएकाले अत्यावश्यक अन्तरिम उपाय माग्नुहोस्","10. Documents":"१०. कागजातहरू","Documents you have (court decisions, medical reports, contracts, ID). Do not upload them here; the officer will ask for copies.":"तपाईंसँग भएका कागजात (अदालतको फैसला, स्वास्थ्य प्रतिवेदन, सम्झौता, परिचयपत्र)। यहाँ अपलोड नगर्नुहोस्; अधिकारीले प्रतिलिपि माग्नेछन्।","I agree that the Clinic may keep these details to assess the case, and will not share them without my permission.":"मुद्दा मूल्याङ्कनका लागि क्लिनिकले यो विवरण राख्न सक्छ र मेरो अनुमतिबिना कसैलाई दिँदैन भन्नेमा म सहमत छु।","Preview the draft":"मस्यौदा हेर्नुहोस्","Send to an IMR officer":"IMR अधिकारीलाई पठाउनुहोस्","Draft communication":"उजुरीको मस्यौदा","Download draft (.doc)":"मस्यौदा डाउनलोड (.doc)","Print":"प्रिन्ट","Start again":"फेरि सुरु गर्नुहोस्","For example: brother, with written consent":"उदाहरण: दाजु, लिखित सहमतिसहित","Which government is responsible for what happened?":"भएको घटनाका लागि कुन सरकार जिम्मेवार छ?","Usually the country where it happened. If officials of one country acted abroad, choose that country.":"सामान्यतया घटना भएको देश। कुनै देशका अधिकारीले विदेशमा काम गरेका हुन् भने त्यही देश छान्नुहोस्।","What happened? Choose all that apply.":"के भयो? लागू हुने सबै छान्नुहोस्।","Is someone at immediate risk?":"के कोही तत्काल खतरामा हुनुहुन्छ?","For example, a deportation in the next days, serious illness in detention, or threats to life.":"जस्तै केही दिनभित्र देश निकाला, हिरासतमा गम्भीर बिरामी, वा ज्यानको धम्की।","What has happened in the national courts or authorities?":"राष्ट्रिय अदालत वा निकायमा के भयो?","Most international bodies only hear a case after national remedies have been used.":"धेरैजसो अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय निकायले राष्ट्रिय उपचार प्रयोग गरेपछि मात्र मुद्दा सुन्छन्।","When was the final national decision?":"अन्तिम राष्ट्रिय निर्णय कहिले भएको थियो?","Has the same case already been sent to another international body?":"के उही मुद्दा अर्को अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय निकायमा पठाइएको छ?","You can check on the OHCHR ratification dashboard (indicators.ohchr.org). If you are not sure, choose \"I don't know\" and the Clinic will check.":"तपाईं OHCHR अनुमोदन ड्यासबोर्ड (indicators.ohchr.org) मा जाँच्न सक्नुहुन्छ। निश्चित हुनुहुन्न भने \"मलाई थाहा छैन\" छान्नुहोस्, क्लिनिकले जाँच्नेछ।","Who would bring the case?":"मुद्दा कसले दायर गर्ने?","Indonesia":"इन्डोनेसिया","Another ASEAN country (for example Malaysia, Singapore, Thailand)":"अर्को आसियान देश (जस्तै मलेसिया, सिङ्गापुर, थाइल्यान्ड)","A Council of Europe country (most of Europe, including the EU and the UK)":"काउन्सिल अफ युरोपको सदस्य देश (युरोपका धेरैजसो, ईयू र बेलायतसहित)","A country in the Americas (OAS member)":"अमेरिका महादेशको देश (OAS सदस्य)","An African Union country":"अफ्रिकी संघको सदस्य देश","A Gulf or Middle Eastern country":"खाडी वा मध्यपूर्वको देश","Somewhere else":"अन्य ठाउँ","Torture, beatings or other ill-treatment":"यातना, कुटपिट वा अन्य दुर्व्यवहार","Detention, including immigration detention":"हिरासत, आप्रवासन हिरासतसहित","Deportation or return to a country where the person is in danger":"व्यक्ति खतरामा पर्ने देशमा देश निकाला वा फिर्ता पठाइनु","Seeking asylum or refugee protection":"शरण वा शरणार्थी संरक्षण माग्नु","Forced labor, trafficking or debt bondage":"जबरजस्ती श्रम, मानव बेचबिखन वा ऋणको बन्धन","Unpaid wages, unsafe work or other abuse at work":"नतिरिएको तलब, असुरक्षित काम वा कार्यस्थलमा अन्य दुर्व्यवहार","Discrimination because of race, nationality or religion":"जाति, राष्ट्रियता वा धर्मका कारण भेदभाव","Violence or discrimination against a woman or girl":"महिला वा बालिकामाथि हिंसा वा भेदभाव","A child was affected":"एउटा बालबालिका प्रभावित भयो","Freedom of expression, religion, family life or a fair trial":"अभिव्यक्ति, धर्म, पारिवारिक जीवन वा निष्पक्ष सुनुवाइको स्वतन्त्रता","Health care, housing or education":"स्वास्थ्य सेवा, आवास वा शिक्षा","No":"होइन","There is a final decision with no further appeal":"अन्तिम निर्णय भइसकेको छ, अब पुनरावेदन छैन","A case is still going on":"मुद्दा अझै चलिरहेको छ","Nothing has been tried yet":"अहिलेसम्म केही गरिएको छैन","It is not possible or not safe to use them, or they do not work":"प्रयोग गर्न सम्भव वा सुरक्षित छैन, वा प्रभावकारी छैन","Less than 4 months ago":"४ महिनाभन्दा कम अघि","4 to 6 months ago":"४ देखि ६ महिना अघि","6 to 12 months ago":"६ देखि १२ महिना अघि","1 to 5 years ago":"१ देखि ५ वर्ष अघि","More than 5 years ago":"५ वर्षभन्दा बढी अघि","Yes, and it is still being examined":"हो, र अझै जाँच भइरहेको छ","Yes, and it has been decided":"हो, र निर्णय भइसकेको छ","Yes, for the relevant treaty":"हो, सम्बन्धित सन्धिका लागि","The person affected":"पीडित व्यक्ति","A relative or lawyer, with the person's consent":"आफन्त वा वकिल, व्यक्तिको सहमतिमा","An organization such as a trade union or NGO":"ट्रेड युनियन वा गैरसरकारी संस्था जस्ता संगठन","I don't know":"मलाई थाहा छैन","Question":"प्रश्न","of":"मध्ये","See the result":"नतिजा हेर्नुहोस्","Please choose an answer to continue.":"अगाडि बढ्न एउटा उत्तर छान्नुहोस्।","Likely open":"सम्भवतः खुला","Possible":"सम्भव","Possible, needs checking":"सम्भव, जाँच आवश्यक","Not yet":"अहिले होइन","Not available":"उपलब्ध छैन","Official page ↗":"आधिकारिक पृष्ठ ↗","Mechanisms that could take the case now: {n}. Others may open later or need checking.":"अहिले मुद्दा लिन सक्ने संयन्त्र: {n}। अरू पछि खुल्न सक्छन् वा जाँच आवश्यक छ।","The explanations below are in English. The Clinic can explain them in your language.":"तलका व्याख्याहरू अङ्ग्रेजीमा छन्। क्लिनिकले तपाईंको भाषामा बुझाउन सक्छ।","If someone is at immediate risk, contact the Clinic now":"कोही तत्काल खतरामा हुनुहुन्छ भने अहिले नै क्लिनिकलाई सम्पर्क गर्नुहोस्","Translations have not yet been reviewed. If anything is unclear, the English version applies.":"अनुवादहरू अझै समीक्षा गरिएका छैनन्। केही अस्पष्ट भए अङ्ग्रेजी संस्करण लागू हुन्छ।","Language":"भाषा","Free of charge":"निःशुल्क","About 15 minutes":"करिब १५ मिनेट","Reviewed by an IMR lawyer":"IMR का वकिलले जाँच्नुहुन्छ","Nothing is filed without your agreement":"तपाईंको सहमतिबिना केही पनि दर्ता गरिँदैन","Check":"जाँच्नुहोस्","Answer a few questions":"केही प्रश्नको उत्तर दिनुहोस्","Choose":"छान्नुहोस्","See where the case can go":"मुद्दा कहाँ जान सक्छ हेर्नुहोस्","Draft and send":"लेख्नुहोस् र पठाउनुहोस्","Write it, then send to IMR":"लेख्नुहोस्, अनि IMR लाई पठाउनुहोस्","Need help filling this in? Call the Clinic on":"यो भर्न मद्दत चाहिन्छ? क्लिनिकलाई यो नम्बरमा फोन गर्नुहोस्","or email":"वा इमेल गर्नुहोस्","Where this case may go":"यो मुद्दा कहाँ जान सक्छ","Answer the first question to see a prediction.":"अनुमान हेर्न पहिलो प्रश्नको उत्तर दिनुहोस्।","The prediction changes as you answer. It is a guide, not legal advice.":"तपाईंले उत्तर दिँदै जाँदा अनुमान बदलिन्छ। यो मार्गदर्शन हो, कानुनी सल्लाह होइन।","Strong fit":"धेरै मिल्छ","Good fit":"राम्रोसँग मिल्छ","Show":"देखाउनुहोस्","Hide":"लुकाउनुहोस्","Predicted fit":"अनुमानित मेल","Listen":"सुन्नुहोस्","Where this case could go":"यो मुद्दा कहाँ जान सक्छ","Can take the case now":"अहिले नै मुद्दा लिन सक्छ","May open later, or needs checking":"पछि खुल्न सक्छ, वा जाँच गर्नुपर्छ","Not available for this case":"यो मुद्दाका लागि उपलब्ध छैन","Draft for this body →":"यो निकायका लागि मस्यौदा →","Guides and model forms":"मार्गदर्शन र नमुना फारम","Draft the communication →":"उजुरीको मस्यौदा लेख्नुहोस् →","Where to send it, and who you are":"कहाँ पठाउने, र तपाईं को हो","Choose the body for this draft. You can change it later.":"यो मस्यौदाका लागि निकाय छान्नुहोस्। पछि बदल्न सकिन्छ।","About you":"तपाईंको बारेमा","(optional)":"(ऐच्छिक)","The person affected and the State":"पीडित व्यक्ति र राज्य","Tell us about the person whose rights were violated.":"जसको अधिकार हनन भयो, उहाँको बारेमा बताउनुहोस्।","The State concerned":"सम्बन्धित राज्य","Country responsible":"जिम्मेवार देश","What happened":"के भयो","Describe the events in date order, in your own words and in any language. The Clinic will help with the legal wording.":"घटनाहरू मितिको क्रममा, आफ्नै शब्दमा र जुनसुकै भाषामा लेख्नुहोस्। कानुनी भाषामा क्लिनिकले मद्दत गर्छ।","You can speak instead of writing.":"लेख्नुको सट्टा बोल्न सक्नुहुन्छ।","Press the red button and tell us what happened, in your own language. Up to 5 minutes.":"रातो बटन थिच्नुहोस् र के भयो आफ्नै भाषामा भन्नुहोस्। बढीमा ५ मिनेट।","Record my story":"मेरो कथा रेकर्ड गर्नुहोस्","Stop recording":"रेकर्डिङ रोक्नुहोस्","Delete and record again":"मेटाएर फेरि रेकर्ड गर्नुहोस्","or write it":"वा लेख्नुहोस्","The facts":"तथ्यहरू","A strong account usually says:":"राम्रो विवरणमा प्रायः यी कुरा हुन्छन्:","who did what, when and where, with dates if you know them;":"कसले के गर्‍यो, कहिले र कहाँ, थाहा भए मितिसहित;","what officials did or failed to do;":"अधिकारीहरूले के गरे वा के गरेनन्;","the harm caused, and what is happening now.":"भएको हानि, र अहिले के भइरहेको छ।","Rights and remedies":"अधिकार र उपचार","These rights are suggested from your answers for the body you chose. Untick any that do not fit; the officer will refine them.":"तपाईंले छान्नुभएको निकायका लागि तपाईंका उत्तरबाट यी अधिकार सुझाइएका हुन्। नमिल्नेमा टिक हटाउनुहोस्; अधिकारीले मिलाउनुहुन्छ।","National remedies":"राष्ट्रिय उपचार","Other international procedures":"अन्य अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय प्रक्रिया","What you are asking for":"तपाईं के माग्दै हुनुहुन्छ","Remedy sought":"माग गरिएको उपचार","(for example release, compensation, halting a deportation, an investigation)":"(जस्तै रिहाइ, क्षतिपूर्ति, देशनिकाला रोक्ने, अनुसन्धान)","Documents":"कागजातहरू","Documents you have":"तपाईंसँग भएका कागजात","(court decisions, medical reports, contracts, ID). Do not upload them here; the officer will ask for copies.":"(अदालतका निर्णय, स्वास्थ्य रिपोर्ट, सम्झौता, परिचयपत्र)। यहाँ अपलोड नगर्नुहोस्; अधिकारीले प्रतिलिपि माग्नुहुनेछ।","Review and send":"हेर्नुहोस् र पठाउनुहोस्","Read the draft below. When you send it, it goes only to the IMR International Legal Clinic, not to any international body. An officer will contact you to review it.":"तलको मस्यौदा पढ्नुहोस्। पठाएपछि यो IMR अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय कानुनी क्लिनिकमा मात्र जान्छ, कुनै अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय निकायमा जाँदैन। अधिकारीले यसलाई हेर्न तपाईंलाई सम्पर्क गर्नुहुनेछ।","Your reference:":"तपाईंको सन्दर्भ नम्बर:","Keep it in case you need to contact the Clinic.":"क्लिनिकलाई सम्पर्क गर्नुपरे काम लाग्छ, सुरक्षित राख्नुहोस्।","How we handle your data: the form is stored by our web host, Netlify, whose servers are mostly in the United States, and is then read only by Clinic staff. If that is a risk for you, download the draft instead and send it to":"हामी तपाईंको तथ्याङ्क कसरी राख्छौं: फारम हाम्रो वेब होस्ट Netlify ले राख्छ, जसका सर्भर धेरैजसो संयुक्त राज्य अमेरिकामा छन्, र त्यसपछि क्लिनिकका कर्मचारीले मात्र पढ्छन्। यो तपाईंका लागि जोखिमपूर्ण भए मस्यौदा डाउनलोड गरेर यहाँ पठाउनुहोस्","or bring it to the Clinic.":"वा क्लिनिकमा ल्याउनुहोस्।","Download (.doc)":"डाउनलोड (.doc)","Send to an IMR lawyer":"IMR का वकिललाई पठाउनुहोस्","Step":"चरण","← Back to results":"← नतिजामा फर्कनुहोस्","Live preview":"प्रत्यक्ष पूर्वावलोकन","Sending…":"पठाउँदै…","The draft could not be sent just now.":"अहिले मस्यौदा पठाउन सकिएन।","Microphone not allowed. Please write instead.":"माइक्रोफोन अनुमति छैन। कृपया लेख्नुहोस्।","Draft in your language":"तपाईंको भाषामा मस्यौदा","Draft in English":"अङ्ग्रेजीमा मस्यौदा","DRAFT FOR REVIEW BY THE IMR INTERNATIONAL LEGAL CLINIC. NOT YET SUBMITTED.":"IMR अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय कानुनी क्लिनिकको समीक्षाका लागि मस्यौदा। अझै दर्ता गरिएको छैन।","To":"प्रापक","Type":"प्रकार","Date":"मिति","IMR reference":"IMR सन्दर्भ नम्बर","INFORMATION ON THE AUTHOR":"लेखकको जानकारी","Name":"नाम","Address for correspondence":"पत्राचार ठेगाना","to be completed with the Clinic":"क्लिनिकसँग मिलेर भरिनेछ","INFORMATION ON THE ALLEGED VICTIM":"कथित पीडितको जानकारी","The author is the alleged victim.":"लेखक नै कथित पीडित हुनुहुन्छ।","Present location":"हालको स्थान","Authority to act":"काम गर्ने अधिकार","written consent of the victim to be attached":"पीडितको लिखित सहमति संलग्न गरिनेछ","STATE CONCERNED":"सम्बन्धित राज्य","FACTS OF THE CASE":"मुद्दाका तथ्यहरू","RIGHTS ALLEGED TO HAVE BEEN VIOLATED":"हनन भएको भनिएका अधिकारहरू","to be identified":"पहिचान गरिनेछ","EXHAUSTION OF DOMESTIC REMEDIES":"राष्ट्रिय उपचारको प्रयोग","Remedies unavailable or ineffective because":"उपचार उपलब्ध नभएको वा प्रभावकारी नभएको कारण","OTHER INTERNATIONAL PROCEDURES":"अन्य अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय प्रक्रिया","REMEDY SOUGHT":"माग गरिएको उपचार","Request for interim measures":"अन्तरिम उपायको अनुरोध","the author asks that the State be requested to take interim measures to avoid irreparable harm to the alleged victim while the communication is under consideration.":"उजुरी विचाराधीन रहँदा कथित पीडितलाई अपूरणीय हानि हुनबाट जोगाउन राज्यलाई अन्तरिम उपाय अपनाउन अनुरोध गरियोस् भनी लेखक माग गर्नुहुन्छ।","SUPPORTING DOCUMENTS":"सहायक कागजातहरू","to be listed":"सूचीबद्ध गरिनेछ","Signature":"हस्ताक्षर","not yet given":"अझै दिइएको छैन","The same matter has not been submitted to any other procedure of international investigation or settlement.":"यही विषय अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय अनुसन्धान वा समाधानको अरू कुनै प्रक्रियामा पेश गरिएको छैन।","Told in a voice message, attached. The Clinic will transcribe it.":"भ्वाइस म्यासेजमा भनिएको, संलग्न छ। क्लिनिकले यसलाई लिखित रूपमा उतार्नेछ।","A voice message is also attached.":"एउटा भ्वाइस म्यासेज पनि संलग्न छ।","Draft for IMR review · not yet submitted":"IMR समीक्षाका लागि मस्यौदा · अझै पेश गरिएको छैन","Easy mode: big pictures, questions read aloud":"सजिलो मोड: ठूला तस्बिर, प्रश्नहरू पढेर सुनाइन्छ","Recruiting agency and employer":"भर्ना एजेन्सी र रोजगारदाता","(if any)":"(भए)","Recruiting agency or agent":"भर्ना एजेन्सी वा एजेन्ट","Name of the company or person who arranged the job":"काम मिलाइदिने कम्पनी वा व्यक्तिको नाम","Employer":"रोजगारदाता","Name of the employer, farm or household":"रोजगारदाता, खेत वा घरपरिवारको नाम","Which country?":"कुन देश?","I'm not sure":"मलाई थाहा छैन","Choose a country":"देश छान्नुहोस्","Has that country accepted individual communications to UN treaty committees?":"के त्यो देशले संयुक्त राष्ट्रसंघका सन्धि समितिमा व्यक्तिगत सञ्चार (कम्युनिकेसन) स्वीकार गरेको छ?","Find out which international bodies can hear your case. Then draft your rights communication step by step, and an IMR lawyer reviews it with you before anything is filed.":"कुन अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय निकायले तपाईंको मुद्दा सुन्न सक्छ, पत्ता लगाउनुहोस्। त्यसपछि आफ्नो अधिकारसम्बन्धी सञ्चार चरणबद्ध रूपमा लेख्नुहोस्; केही दर्ता गर्नुअघि IMR का वकिलले तपाईंसँगै यसलाई हेर्नुहुन्छ।","This lets us check which UN communication procedures that country has accepted.":"यसले त्यो देशले संयुक्त राष्ट्रसंघका कुन सञ्चार प्रक्रिया स्वीकार गरेको छ भनी जाँच्न मद्दत गर्छ।","Before anything is filed, the person affected must sign an authorization letting you, or IMR, act for them. If they cannot sign, for example because they are detained, the Clinic officer will explain what can be done instead.":"केही दर्ता गर्नुअघि, पीडित व्यक्तिले तपाईं वा IMR लाई आफ्नो तर्फबाट काम गर्ने अख्तियारनामामा हस्ताक्षर गर्नुपर्छ। उहाँ हस्ताक्षर गर्न सक्नुहुन्न भने, जस्तै थुनामा हुनुहुन्छ भने, क्लिनिकका अधिकारीले अरू के गर्न सकिन्छ भनी बुझाउनुहुनेछ।"},"tl":{"International Legal Clinic":"Pandaigdigang Legal Clinic","Prepare a human rights communication":"Maghanda ng komunikasyon tungkol sa karapatang pantao","Answer a few questions about what happened. At the end you will see which international human rights mechanisms could receive the case, which cannot, and why. Then a guided form helps you draft the communication itself, which an IMR Clinic officer reviews before the next stage. There is no charge.":"Sagutin ang ilang tanong tungkol sa nangyari. Sa dulo, makikita mo kung aling mga internasyonal na mekanismo ng karapatang pantao ang maaaring tumanggap ng kaso, alin ang hindi, at kung bakit. Pagkatapos, tutulungan ka ng isang gabay na form na isulat ang komunikasyon, na susuriin ng isang opisyal ng IMR Clinic bago ang susunod na hakbang. Walang bayad.","Back":"Bumalik","Next":"Susunod","Your result":"Ang iyong resulta","Mechanisms that could receive this case":"Mga mekanismong maaaring tumanggap ng kasong ito","This checker is a guide, not legal advice. Rules change and every mechanism has further conditions, so the Clinic will check the details before anything is filed. Treaty acceptance for Indonesia was last checked in October 2026; for other countries, see the":"Gabay ito, hindi legal na payo. Nagbabago ang mga patakaran at may iba pang kondisyon ang bawat mekanismo, kaya susuriin ng Clinic ang mga detalye bago maghain ng anuman. Huling sinuri ang pagtanggap ng Indonesia sa mga kasunduan noong Oktubre 2026; para sa ibang bansa, tingnan ang","OHCHR ratification dashboard":"OHCHR ratification dashboard","Draft the communication":"Isulat ang komunikasyon","Fill in what you can. The page turns your answers into a draft communication in the form the chosen body expects. An IMR Clinic officer then reviews it with you before anything is filed. Nothing is sent to any international body from this page.":"Punan ang kaya mo. Gagawing draft na komunikasyon ng pahinang ito ang iyong mga sagot, ayon sa anyong hinihingi ng napiling lupon. Susuriin ito kasama mo ng isang opisyal ng IMR Clinic bago maghain ng anuman. Walang ipinapadala sa anumang internasyonal na lupon mula sa pahinang ito.","1. Where to send it":"1. Saan ipapadala","Mechanism":"Mekanismo","2. Author of the communication":"2. May-akda ng komunikasyon","Full name":"Buong pangalan","Nationality":"Nasyonalidad","Date of birth":"Petsa ng kapanganakan","Safe contact: email, phone or WhatsApp":"Ligtas na contact: email, telepono o WhatsApp","Are you the person affected?":"Ikaw ba ang taong naapektuhan?","Yes":"Oo","No, I am acting for them":"Hindi, kumikilos ako para sa kanya","3. The person affected":"3. Ang taong naapektuhan","Where they are now":"Kung nasaan siya ngayon","Your relationship to them, and whether they have agreed":"Ang relasyon mo sa kanya, at kung pumayag siya","4. The State concerned":"4. Ang Estadong sangkot","Country":"Bansa","5. The facts":"5. Ang mga pangyayari","What happened, in date order: who did what, when and where":"Ang nangyari ayon sa petsa: sino ang gumawa ng ano, kailan at saan","6. Rights violated":"6. Mga nilabag na karapatan","Suggested from your answers for the chosen mechanism. Untick any that do not fit; the officer will refine them.":"Iminungkahi batay sa iyong mga sagot para sa napiling mekanismo. Alisin ang tsek sa hindi angkop; aayusin ito ng opisyal.","7. National remedies":"7. Mga lunas sa loob ng bansa","Courts or authorities approached, with dates and results":"Mga korte o awtoridad na nilapitan, kasama ang petsa at resulta","If none were used, why not?":"Kung wala, bakit?","8. Other international procedures":"8. Iba pang internasyonal na proseso","Has this been sent anywhere else? Give the body, date and result.":"Naipadala na ba ito sa iba? Ibigay ang lupon, petsa at resulta.","9. What you are asking for":"9. Ang iyong hinihiling","Remedy sought (for example release, compensation, halting a deportation, investigation)":"Hinihinging lunas (halimbawa paglaya, bayad-pinsala, pagpigil sa deportasyon, imbestigasyon)","Ask for urgent interim measures because someone is at immediate risk":"Humiling ng agarang pansamantalang hakbang dahil may taong nasa agarang panganib","10. Documents":"10. Mga dokumento","Documents you have (court decisions, medical reports, contracts, ID). Do not upload them here; the officer will ask for copies.":"Mga dokumentong hawak mo (desisyon ng korte, medical report, kontrata, ID). Huwag i-upload dito; hihingin ng opisyal ang mga kopya.","I agree that the Clinic may keep these details to assess the case, and will not share them without my permission.":"Pumapayag ako na itago ng Clinic ang mga detalyeng ito para suriin ang kaso, at hindi ito ibabahagi nang wala akong pahintulot.","Preview the draft":"Tingnan ang draft","Send to an IMR officer":"Ipadala sa opisyal ng IMR","Draft communication":"Draft na komunikasyon","Download draft (.doc)":"I-download ang draft (.doc)","Print":"I-print","Start again":"Magsimula ulit","For example: brother, with written consent":"Halimbawa: kapatid, may nakasulat na pahintulot","Which government is responsible for what happened?":"Aling pamahalaan ang may pananagutan sa nangyari?","Usually the country where it happened. If officials of one country acted abroad, choose that country.":"Kadalasan, ang bansa kung saan ito nangyari. Kung kumilos sa ibang bansa ang mga opisyal ng isang bansa, piliin ang bansang iyon.","What happened? Choose all that apply.":"Ano ang nangyari? Piliin lahat ng angkop.","Is someone at immediate risk?":"May tao bang nasa agarang panganib?","For example, a deportation in the next days, serious illness in detention, or threats to life.":"Halimbawa, deportasyon sa mga susunod na araw, malubhang sakit habang nakakulong, o banta sa buhay.","What has happened in the national courts or authorities?":"Ano na ang nangyari sa mga korte o awtoridad ng bansa?","Most international bodies only hear a case after national remedies have been used.":"Karamihan sa mga internasyonal na lupon ay dumirinig lamang ng kaso kapag nagamit na ang mga lunas sa loob ng bansa.","When was the final national decision?":"Kailan ang huling desisyon sa loob ng bansa?","Has the same case already been sent to another international body?":"Naipadala na ba ang parehong kaso sa ibang internasyonal na lupon?","You can check on the OHCHR ratification dashboard (indicators.ohchr.org). If you are not sure, choose \"I don't know\" and the Clinic will check.":"Masusuri mo ito sa OHCHR ratification dashboard (indicators.ohchr.org). Kung hindi sigurado, piliin ang \"Hindi ko alam\" at susuriin ito ng Clinic.","Who would bring the case?":"Sino ang magsasampa ng kaso?","Indonesia":"Indonesia","Another ASEAN country (for example Malaysia, Singapore, Thailand)":"Ibang bansa sa ASEAN (halimbawa Malaysia, Singapore, Thailand)","A Council of Europe country (most of Europe, including the EU and the UK)":"Bansang kasapi ng Council of Europe (karamihan ng Europa, kasama ang EU at UK)","A country in the Americas (OAS member)":"Bansa sa Amerika (kasapi ng OAS)","An African Union country":"Bansang kasapi ng African Union","A Gulf or Middle Eastern country":"Bansa sa Gulf o Gitnang Silangan","Somewhere else":"Ibang lugar","Torture, beatings or other ill-treatment":"Tortyur, pambubugbog o iba pang pagmamalupit","Detention, including immigration detention":"Pagkakakulong, kasama ang immigration detention","Deportation or return to a country where the person is in danger":"Deportasyon o pagbabalik sa bansang may panganib sa tao","Seeking asylum or refugee protection":"Paghingi ng asylum o proteksyon bilang refugee","Forced labor, trafficking or debt bondage":"Sapilitang paggawa, human trafficking o pagkakautang na pang-aalipin","Unpaid wages, unsafe work or other abuse at work":"Hindi binayarang sahod, mapanganib na trabaho o iba pang pang-aabuso sa trabaho","Discrimination because of race, nationality or religion":"Diskriminasyon dahil sa lahi, nasyonalidad o relihiyon","Violence or discrimination against a woman or girl":"Karahasan o diskriminasyon laban sa babae o batang babae","A child was affected":"May batang naapektuhan","Freedom of expression, religion, family life or a fair trial":"Kalayaan sa pagpapahayag, relihiyon, buhay-pamilya o patas na paglilitis","Health care, housing or education":"Pangangalagang pangkalusugan, pabahay o edukasyon","No":"Hindi","There is a final decision with no further appeal":"May pinal na desisyon na wala nang apela","A case is still going on":"Tuloy pa ang kaso","Nothing has been tried yet":"Wala pang nagagawa","It is not possible or not safe to use them, or they do not work":"Hindi posible o hindi ligtas gamitin, o hindi epektibo","Less than 4 months ago":"Wala pang 4 na buwan","4 to 6 months ago":"4 hanggang 6 na buwan na","6 to 12 months ago":"6 hanggang 12 buwan na","1 to 5 years ago":"1 hanggang 5 taon na","More than 5 years ago":"Mahigit 5 taon na","Yes, and it is still being examined":"Oo, at sinusuri pa","Yes, and it has been decided":"Oo, at may desisyon na","Yes, for the relevant treaty":"Oo, para sa kaukulang kasunduan","The person affected":"Ang taong naapektuhan","A relative or lawyer, with the person's consent":"Kamag-anak o abogado, nang may pahintulot ng tao","An organization such as a trade union or NGO":"Organisasyon tulad ng unyon o NGO","I don't know":"Hindi ko alam","Question":"Tanong","of":"sa","See the result":"Tingnan ang resulta","Please choose an answer to continue.":"Pumili ng sagot para magpatuloy.","Likely open":"Malamang bukas","Possible":"Posible","Possible, needs checking":"Posible, kailangang suriin","Not yet":"Hindi pa","Not available":"Hindi available","Official page ↗":"Opisyal na pahina ↗","Mechanisms that could take the case now: {n}. Others may open later or need checking.":"Mga mekanismong maaaring tumanggap ng kaso ngayon: {n}. Ang iba ay maaaring magbukas mamaya o kailangang suriin.","The explanations below are in English. The Clinic can explain them in your language.":"Nasa Ingles ang mga paliwanag sa ibaba. Maipapaliwanag ito ng Clinic sa iyong wika.","If someone is at immediate risk, contact the Clinic now":"Kung may taong nasa agarang panganib, tawagan ang Clinic ngayon","Translations have not yet been reviewed. If anything is unclear, the English version applies.":"Hindi pa nasusuri ang mga salin. Kung may hindi malinaw, ang bersyong Ingles ang susundin.","Language":"Wika","Free of charge":"Libre","About 15 minutes":"Mga 15 minuto","Reviewed by an IMR lawyer":"Susuriin ng isang abogado ng IMR","Nothing is filed without your agreement":"Walang isasampa nang wala kang pahintulot","Check":"Suriin","Answer a few questions":"Sagutin ang ilang tanong","Choose":"Pumili","See where the case can go":"Tingnan kung saan maaaring dalhin ang kaso","Draft and send":"Isulat at ipadala","Write it, then send to IMR":"Isulat ito, saka ipadala sa IMR","Need help filling this in? Call the Clinic on":"Kailangan ng tulong sa pagsagot? Tawagan ang Clinic sa","or email":"o mag-email sa","Where this case may go":"Saan maaaring dalhin ang kasong ito","Answer the first question to see a prediction.":"Sagutin ang unang tanong para makita ang hula.","The prediction changes as you answer. It is a guide, not legal advice.":"Nagbabago ang hula habang sumasagot ka. Gabay ito, hindi legal na payo.","Strong fit":"Malakas na tugma","Good fit":"Magandang tugma","Show":"Ipakita","Hide":"Itago","Predicted fit":"Hinulaang tugma","Listen":"Pakinggan","Where this case could go":"Saan maaaring dalhin ang kasong ito","Can take the case now":"Maaaring tumanggap ng kaso ngayon","May open later, or needs checking":"Maaaring magbukas mamaya, o kailangang suriin","Not available for this case":"Hindi magagamit para sa kasong ito","Draft for this body →":"Isulat para sa lupong ito →","Guides and model forms":"Mga gabay at modelong form","Draft the communication →":"Isulat ang komunikasyon →","Where to send it, and who you are":"Saan ito ipapadala, at sino ka","Choose the body for this draft. You can change it later.":"Piliin ang lupon para sa draft na ito. Maaari mo itong palitan mamaya.","About you":"Tungkol sa iyo","(optional)":"(opsyonal)","The person affected and the State":"Ang taong naapektuhan at ang Estado","Tell us about the person whose rights were violated.":"Sabihin sa amin ang tungkol sa taong nilabag ang mga karapatan.","The State concerned":"Ang Estadong sangkot","Country responsible":"Bansang may pananagutan","What happened":"Ano ang nangyari","Describe the events in date order, in your own words and in any language. The Clinic will help with the legal wording.":"Ilarawan ang mga pangyayari ayon sa pagkakasunod ng petsa, sa sarili mong salita at sa anumang wika. Tutulong ang Clinic sa legal na pananalita.","You can speak instead of writing.":"Maaari kang magsalita sa halip na sumulat.","Press the red button and tell us what happened, in your own language. Up to 5 minutes.":"Pindutin ang pulang button at sabihin sa amin ang nangyari, sa sarili mong wika. Hanggang 5 minuto.","Record my story":"I-record ang aking kuwento","Stop recording":"Itigil ang pag-record","Delete and record again":"Burahin at mag-record muli","or write it":"o isulat ito","The facts":"Ang mga pangyayari","A strong account usually says:":"Karaniwang sinasabi ng isang malakas na salaysay:","who did what, when and where, with dates if you know them;":"sino ang gumawa ng ano, kailan at saan, kasama ang mga petsa kung alam mo;","what officials did or failed to do;":"ano ang ginawa o hindi ginawa ng mga opisyal;","the harm caused, and what is happening now.":"ang pinsalang idinulot, at ano ang nangyayari ngayon.","Rights and remedies":"Mga karapatan at lunas","These rights are suggested from your answers for the body you chose. Untick any that do not fit; the officer will refine them.":"Iminumungkahi ang mga karapatang ito batay sa iyong mga sagot para sa lupong pinili mo. Alisin ang tsek sa mga hindi angkop; pipinuhin ito ng opisyal.","National remedies":"Mga lunas sa sariling bansa","Other international procedures":"Iba pang internasyonal na proseso","What you are asking for":"Ang hinihiling mo","Remedy sought":"Hinihinging lunas","(for example release, compensation, halting a deportation, an investigation)":"(halimbawa: paglaya, kabayaran, pagpigil sa deportasyon, isang imbestigasyon)","Documents":"Mga dokumento","Documents you have":"Mga dokumentong hawak mo","(court decisions, medical reports, contracts, ID). Do not upload them here; the officer will ask for copies.":"(mga desisyon ng korte, ulat medikal, kontrata, ID). Huwag i-upload dito; hihingi ng kopya ang opisyal.","Review and send":"Suriin at ipadala","Read the draft below. When you send it, it goes only to the IMR International Legal Clinic, not to any international body. An officer will contact you to review it.":"Basahin ang draft sa ibaba. Kapag ipinadala mo ito, mapupunta lamang ito sa IMR International Legal Clinic, hindi sa anumang internasyonal na lupon. Kokontakin ka ng isang opisyal para suriin ito.","Your reference:":"Ang iyong reference:","Keep it in case you need to contact the Clinic.":"Itago ito kung sakaling kailangan mong kontakin ang Clinic.","How we handle your data: the form is stored by our web host, Netlify, whose servers are mostly in the United States, and is then read only by Clinic staff. If that is a risk for you, download the draft instead and send it to":"Paano namin hinahawakan ang iyong datos: ang form ay iniimbak ng aming web host, ang Netlify, na karamihan ng server ay nasa Estados Unidos, at pagkatapos ay binabasa lamang ng mga kawani ng Clinic. Kung delikado iyon para sa iyo, i-download na lang ang draft at ipadala ito sa","or bring it to the Clinic.":"o dalhin ito sa Clinic.","Download (.doc)":"I-download (.doc)","Send to an IMR lawyer":"Ipadala sa isang abogado ng IMR","Step":"Hakbang","← Back to results":"← Bumalik sa mga resulta","Live preview":"Live na preview","Sending…":"Ipinapadala…","The draft could not be sent just now.":"Hindi maipadala ang draft sa ngayon.","Microphone not allowed. Please write instead.":"Hindi pinayagan ang mikropono. Pakisulat na lang.","Draft in your language":"Draft sa iyong wika","Draft in English":"Draft sa Ingles","DRAFT FOR REVIEW BY THE IMR INTERNATIONAL LEGAL CLINIC. NOT YET SUBMITTED.":"DRAFT PARA SURIIN NG IMR INTERNATIONAL LEGAL CLINIC. HINDI PA ISINASAMPA.","To":"Para kay","Type":"Uri","Date":"Petsa","IMR reference":"Reference ng IMR","INFORMATION ON THE AUTHOR":"IMPORMASYON TUNGKOL SA MAY-AKDA","Name":"Pangalan","Address for correspondence":"Address para sa sulatan","to be completed with the Clinic":"kukumpletuhin kasama ang Clinic","INFORMATION ON THE ALLEGED VICTIM":"IMPORMASYON TUNGKOL SA DI-UMANONG BIKTIMA","The author is the alleged victim.":"Ang may-akda ang di-umanong biktima.","Present location":"Kasalukuyang kinaroroonan","Authority to act":"Awtoridad na kumilos","written consent of the victim to be attached":"ilalakip ang nakasulat na pahintulot ng biktima","STATE CONCERNED":"ESTADONG SANGKOT","FACTS OF THE CASE":"MGA PANGYAYARI SA KASO","RIGHTS ALLEGED TO HAVE BEEN VIOLATED":"MGA KARAPATANG DI-UMANO'Y NILABAG","to be identified":"tutukuyin pa","EXHAUSTION OF DOMESTIC REMEDIES":"PAGGAMIT SA MGA LUNAS SA SARILING BANSA","Remedies unavailable or ineffective because":"Hindi magagamit o hindi epektibo ang mga lunas dahil","OTHER INTERNATIONAL PROCEDURES":"IBA PANG INTERNASYONAL NA PROSESO","REMEDY SOUGHT":"HINIHINGING LUNAS","Request for interim measures":"Kahilingan para sa pansamantalang hakbang","the author asks that the State be requested to take interim measures to avoid irreparable harm to the alleged victim while the communication is under consideration.":"hinihiling ng may-akda na hilingin sa Estado na gumawa ng pansamantalang hakbang upang maiwasan ang di-maibabalik na pinsala sa di-umanong biktima habang isinasaalang-alang ang komunikasyon.","SUPPORTING DOCUMENTS":"MGA SUMUSUPORTANG DOKUMENTO","to be listed":"ililista pa","Signature":"Lagda","not yet given":"hindi pa naibibigay","The same matter has not been submitted to any other procedure of international investigation or settlement.":"Ang parehong usapin ay hindi pa naisusumite sa anumang ibang proseso ng internasyonal na imbestigasyon o pag-aayos.","Told in a voice message, attached. The Clinic will transcribe it.":"Isinalaysay sa isang voice message, nakalakip. Isusulat ito ng Clinic.","A voice message is also attached.":"May nakalakip ding voice message.","Draft for IMR review · not yet submitted":"Draft para suriin ng IMR · hindi pa isinusumite","Easy mode: big pictures, questions read aloud":"Madaling mode: malalaking larawan, binabasa nang malakas ang mga tanong","Recruiting agency and employer":"Recruitment agency at employer","(if any)":"(kung mayroon)","Recruiting agency or agent":"Recruitment agency o ahente","Name of the company or person who arranged the job":"Pangalan ng kumpanya o taong nag-ayos ng trabaho","Employer":"Employer","Name of the employer, farm or household":"Pangalan ng employer, bukid o sambahayan","Which country?":"Aling bansa?","I'm not sure":"Hindi ako sigurado","Choose a country":"Pumili ng bansa","Has that country accepted individual communications to UN treaty committees?":"Tumatanggap ba ang bansang iyon ng indibidwal na komunikasyon sa mga komite ng kasunduan ng UN?","Find out which international bodies can hear your case. Then draft your rights communication step by step, and an IMR lawyer reviews it with you before anything is filed.":"Alamin kung aling mga internasyonal na lupon ang maaaring duminig sa iyong kaso. Pagkatapos, isulat ang iyong komunikasyon tungkol sa karapatan nang paisa-isang hakbang, at susuriin ito ng isang abogado ng IMR kasama mo bago may maisampa.","This lets us check which UN communication procedures that country has accepted.":"Dito namin malalaman kung aling mga proseso ng komunikasyon sa UN ang tinanggap ng bansang iyon.","Before anything is filed, the person affected must sign an authorization letting you, or IMR, act for them. If they cannot sign, for example because they are detained, the Clinic officer will explain what can be done instead.":"Bago may maisampa, kailangang pumirma ang taong naapektuhan sa isang awtorisasyon na nagpapahintulot sa iyo, o sa IMR, na kumilos para sa kanya. Kung hindi siya makapirma, halimbawa dahil nakakulong siya, ipapaliwanag ng opisyal ng Clinic kung ano ang maaaring gawin."},"vi":{"International Legal Clinic":"Phòng tư vấn pháp lý quốc tế","Prepare a human rights communication":"Soạn thông báo về vi phạm nhân quyền","Answer a few questions about what happened. At the end you will see which international human rights mechanisms could receive the case, which cannot, and why. Then a guided form helps you draft the communication itself, which an IMR Clinic officer reviews before the next stage. There is no charge.":"Hãy trả lời vài câu hỏi về những gì đã xảy ra. Cuối cùng, bạn sẽ thấy những cơ chế nhân quyền quốc tế nào có thể tiếp nhận vụ việc, cơ chế nào không, và lý do. Sau đó, một biểu mẫu hướng dẫn giúp bạn soạn thông báo, và một cán bộ của Phòng tư vấn IMR sẽ xem xét trước bước tiếp theo. Hoàn toàn miễn phí.","Back":"Quay lại","Next":"Tiếp","Your result":"Kết quả của bạn","Mechanisms that could receive this case":"Các cơ chế có thể tiếp nhận vụ việc này","This checker is a guide, not legal advice. Rules change and every mechanism has further conditions, so the Clinic will check the details before anything is filed. Treaty acceptance for Indonesia was last checked in October 2026; for other countries, see the":"Công cụ này chỉ để hướng dẫn, không phải tư vấn pháp lý. Quy định có thể thay đổi và mỗi cơ chế còn có điều kiện khác, nên Phòng tư vấn sẽ kiểm tra chi tiết trước khi nộp bất cứ điều gì. Việc Indonesia chấp nhận các điều ước được kiểm tra lần cuối vào tháng 10/2026; với các nước khác, hãy xem","OHCHR ratification dashboard":"bảng phê chuẩn điều ước của OHCHR","Draft the communication":"Soạn thông báo","Fill in what you can. The page turns your answers into a draft communication in the form the chosen body expects. An IMR Clinic officer then reviews it with you before anything is filed. Nothing is sent to any international body from this page.":"Điền những gì bạn có thể. Trang này chuyển câu trả lời của bạn thành bản thảo thông báo theo mẫu mà cơ quan được chọn yêu cầu. Sau đó cán bộ Phòng tư vấn IMR sẽ cùng bạn xem lại trước khi nộp. Trang này không gửi gì đến bất kỳ cơ quan quốc tế nào.","1. Where to send it":"1. Gửi đến đâu","Mechanism":"Cơ chế","2. Author of the communication":"2. Người gửi thông báo","Full name":"Họ và tên","Nationality":"Quốc tịch","Date of birth":"Ngày sinh","Safe contact: email, phone or WhatsApp":"Cách liên lạc an toàn: email, điện thoại hoặc WhatsApp","Are you the person affected?":"Bạn có phải là người bị ảnh hưởng không?","Yes":"Có","No, I am acting for them":"Không, tôi đại diện cho họ","3. The person affected":"3. Người bị ảnh hưởng","Where they are now":"Nơi họ đang ở","Your relationship to them, and whether they have agreed":"Quan hệ của bạn với họ, và họ đã đồng ý chưa","4. The State concerned":"4. Quốc gia liên quan","Country":"Quốc gia","5. The facts":"5. Sự việc","What happened, in date order: who did what, when and where":"Những gì đã xảy ra theo thứ tự thời gian: ai làm gì, khi nào và ở đâu","6. Rights violated":"6. Các quyền bị vi phạm","Suggested from your answers for the chosen mechanism. Untick any that do not fit; the officer will refine them.":"Được gợi ý từ câu trả lời của bạn cho cơ chế đã chọn. Bỏ chọn mục không phù hợp; cán bộ sẽ chỉnh sửa.","7. National remedies":"7. Biện pháp khắc phục trong nước","Courts or authorities approached, with dates and results":"Tòa án hoặc cơ quan đã tìm đến, kèm ngày tháng và kết quả","If none were used, why not?":"Nếu chưa dùng biện pháp nào, vì sao?","8. Other international procedures":"8. Thủ tục quốc tế khác","Has this been sent anywhere else? Give the body, date and result.":"Vụ việc đã được gửi đến nơi khác chưa? Ghi tên cơ quan, ngày và kết quả.","9. What you are asking for":"9. Bạn yêu cầu gì","Remedy sought (for example release, compensation, halting a deportation, investigation)":"Biện pháp yêu cầu (ví dụ trả tự do, bồi thường, dừng trục xuất, điều tra)","Ask for urgent interim measures because someone is at immediate risk":"Yêu cầu biện pháp tạm thời khẩn cấp vì có người đang gặp nguy hiểm trước mắt","10. Documents":"10. Tài liệu","Documents you have (court decisions, medical reports, contracts, ID). Do not upload them here; the officer will ask for copies.":"Tài liệu bạn có (bản án, báo cáo y tế, hợp đồng, giấy tờ tùy thân). Đừng tải lên đây; cán bộ sẽ xin bản sao.","I agree that the Clinic may keep these details to assess the case, and will not share them without my permission.":"Tôi đồng ý để Phòng tư vấn lưu các thông tin này để đánh giá vụ việc, và không chia sẻ khi chưa có sự cho phép của tôi.","Preview the draft":"Xem bản thảo","Send to an IMR officer":"Gửi cho cán bộ IMR","Draft communication":"Bản thảo thông báo","Download draft (.doc)":"Tải bản thảo (.doc)","Print":"In","Start again":"Làm lại từ đầu","For example: brother, with written consent":"Ví dụ: anh trai, có đồng ý bằng văn bản","Which government is responsible for what happened?":"Chính phủ nào chịu trách nhiệm về sự việc?","Usually the country where it happened. If officials of one country acted abroad, choose that country.":"Thường là quốc gia nơi sự việc xảy ra. Nếu quan chức của một nước hành động ở nước ngoài, hãy chọn nước đó.","What happened? Choose all that apply.":"Đã xảy ra chuyện gì? Chọn tất cả các mục phù hợp.","Is someone at immediate risk?":"Có ai đang gặp nguy hiểm trước mắt không?","For example, a deportation in the next days, serious illness in detention, or threats to life.":"Ví dụ: sắp bị trục xuất trong vài ngày, bệnh nặng khi bị giam giữ, hoặc bị đe dọa tính mạng.","What has happened in the national courts or authorities?":"Đã có gì xảy ra tại tòa án hoặc cơ quan trong nước?","Most international bodies only hear a case after national remedies have been used.":"Hầu hết các cơ quan quốc tế chỉ xem xét vụ việc sau khi đã sử dụng các biện pháp khắc phục trong nước.","When was the final national decision?":"Quyết định cuối cùng trong nước được đưa ra khi nào?","Has the same case already been sent to another international body?":"Vụ việc này đã được gửi đến cơ quan quốc tế khác chưa?","You can check on the OHCHR ratification dashboard (indicators.ohchr.org). If you are not sure, choose \"I don't know\" and the Clinic will check.":"Bạn có thể kiểm tra tại bảng phê chuẩn của OHCHR (indicators.ohchr.org). Nếu không chắc, hãy chọn \"Tôi không biết\" và Phòng tư vấn sẽ kiểm tra.","Who would bring the case?":"Ai sẽ đưa vụ việc ra?","Indonesia":"Indonesia","Another ASEAN country (for example Malaysia, Singapore, Thailand)":"Một nước ASEAN khác (ví dụ Malaysia, Singapore, Thái Lan)","A Council of Europe country (most of Europe, including the EU and the UK)":"Một nước thành viên Hội đồng châu Âu (phần lớn châu Âu, gồm EU và Anh)","A country in the Americas (OAS member)":"Một nước ở châu Mỹ (thành viên OAS)","An African Union country":"Một nước thành viên Liên minh châu Phi","A Gulf or Middle Eastern country":"Một nước vùng Vịnh hoặc Trung Đông","Somewhere else":"Nơi khác","Torture, beatings or other ill-treatment":"Tra tấn, đánh đập hoặc ngược đãi khác","Detention, including immigration detention":"Bị giam giữ, kể cả giam giữ di trú","Deportation or return to a country where the person is in danger":"Bị trục xuất hoặc đưa về nước nơi người đó gặp nguy hiểm","Seeking asylum or refugee protection":"Xin tị nạn hoặc bảo hộ người tị nạn","Forced labor, trafficking or debt bondage":"Lao động cưỡng bức, buôn người hoặc nô lệ do nợ","Unpaid wages, unsafe work or other abuse at work":"Bị nợ lương, làm việc không an toàn hoặc bị ngược đãi khác nơi làm việc","Discrimination because of race, nationality or religion":"Phân biệt đối xử vì chủng tộc, quốc tịch hoặc tôn giáo","Violence or discrimination against a woman or girl":"Bạo lực hoặc phân biệt đối xử với phụ nữ hoặc trẻ em gái","A child was affected":"Có trẻ em bị ảnh hưởng","Freedom of expression, religion, family life or a fair trial":"Tự do ngôn luận, tôn giáo, đời sống gia đình hoặc xét xử công bằng","Health care, housing or education":"Chăm sóc sức khỏe, nhà ở hoặc giáo dục","No":"Không","There is a final decision with no further appeal":"Đã có quyết định cuối cùng, không thể kháng cáo nữa","A case is still going on":"Vụ việc vẫn đang được giải quyết","Nothing has been tried yet":"Chưa làm gì","It is not possible or not safe to use them, or they do not work":"Không thể hoặc không an toàn để sử dụng, hoặc không hiệu quả","Less than 4 months ago":"Chưa đến 4 tháng trước","4 to 6 months ago":"4 đến 6 tháng trước","6 to 12 months ago":"6 đến 12 tháng trước","1 to 5 years ago":"1 đến 5 năm trước","More than 5 years ago":"Hơn 5 năm trước","Yes, and it is still being examined":"Có, và vẫn đang được xem xét","Yes, and it has been decided":"Có, và đã có quyết định","Yes, for the relevant treaty":"Có, đối với điều ước liên quan","The person affected":"Người bị ảnh hưởng","A relative or lawyer, with the person's consent":"Người thân hoặc luật sư, với sự đồng ý của người đó","An organization such as a trade union or NGO":"Một tổ chức như công đoàn hoặc tổ chức phi chính phủ","I don't know":"Tôi không biết","Question":"Câu hỏi","of":"trên","See the result":"Xem kết quả","Please choose an answer to continue.":"Vui lòng chọn một câu trả lời để tiếp tục.","Likely open":"Có khả năng mở","Possible":"Có thể","Possible, needs checking":"Có thể, cần kiểm tra","Not yet":"Chưa","Not available":"Không áp dụng được","Official page ↗":"Trang chính thức ↗","Mechanisms that could take the case now: {n}. Others may open later or need checking.":"Số cơ chế có thể tiếp nhận vụ việc ngay bây giờ: {n}. Các cơ chế khác có thể mở sau hoặc cần kiểm tra.","The explanations below are in English. The Clinic can explain them in your language.":"Phần giải thích dưới đây bằng tiếng Anh. Phòng tư vấn có thể giải thích bằng ngôn ngữ của bạn.","If someone is at immediate risk, contact the Clinic now":"Nếu có người đang gặp nguy hiểm trước mắt, hãy liên hệ Phòng tư vấn ngay","Translations have not yet been reviewed. If anything is unclear, the English version applies.":"Bản dịch chưa được kiểm duyệt. Nếu có điều gì chưa rõ, bản tiếng Anh sẽ được áp dụng.","Language":"Ngôn ngữ","Free of charge":"Miễn phí","About 15 minutes":"Khoảng 15 phút","Reviewed by an IMR lawyer":"Được luật sư IMR xem lại","Nothing is filed without your agreement":"Không nộp gì nếu bạn chưa đồng ý","Check":"Kiểm tra","Answer a few questions":"Trả lời vài câu hỏi","Choose":"Chọn","See where the case can go":"Xem vụ việc có thể được gửi đến đâu","Draft and send":"Soạn và gửi","Write it, then send to IMR":"Viết, rồi gửi cho IMR","Need help filling this in? Call the Clinic on":"Cần giúp điền mẫu này? Gọi cho Phòng tư vấn theo số","or email":"hoặc gửi email tới","Where this case may go":"Vụ việc này có thể được gửi đến đâu","Answer the first question to see a prediction.":"Trả lời câu hỏi đầu tiên để xem dự đoán.","The prediction changes as you answer. It is a guide, not legal advice.":"Dự đoán thay đổi theo câu trả lời của bạn. Đây là hướng dẫn, không phải tư vấn pháp lý.","Strong fit":"Rất phù hợp","Good fit":"Phù hợp","Show":"Hiện","Hide":"Ẩn","Predicted fit":"Mức phù hợp dự đoán","Listen":"Nghe","Where this case could go":"Vụ việc này có thể được gửi đến đâu","Can take the case now":"Có thể nhận vụ việc ngay","May open later, or needs checking":"Có thể mở sau, hoặc cần kiểm tra","Not available for this case":"Không áp dụng cho vụ việc này","Draft for this body →":"Soạn cho cơ quan này →","Guides and model forms":"Hướng dẫn và mẫu đơn","Draft the communication →":"Soạn thông tin khiếu nại →","Where to send it, and who you are":"Gửi đến đâu, và bạn là ai","Choose the body for this draft. You can change it later.":"Chọn cơ quan cho bản nháp này. Bạn có thể đổi sau.","About you":"Về bạn","(optional)":"(không bắt buộc)","The person affected and the State":"Người bị ảnh hưởng và Quốc gia","Tell us about the person whose rights were violated.":"Cho chúng tôi biết về người bị vi phạm quyền.","The State concerned":"Quốc gia liên quan","Country responsible":"Quốc gia chịu trách nhiệm","What happened":"Điều gì đã xảy ra","Describe the events in date order, in your own words and in any language. The Clinic will help with the legal wording.":"Kể lại sự việc theo thứ tự thời gian, bằng lời của bạn và bằng bất kỳ ngôn ngữ nào. Phòng tư vấn sẽ giúp phần ngôn ngữ pháp lý.","You can speak instead of writing.":"Bạn có thể nói thay vì viết.","Press the red button and tell us what happened, in your own language. Up to 5 minutes.":"Bấm nút đỏ và kể cho chúng tôi điều đã xảy ra, bằng ngôn ngữ của bạn. Tối đa 5 phút.","Record my story":"Ghi âm câu chuyện của tôi","Stop recording":"Dừng ghi âm","Delete and record again":"Xóa và ghi âm lại","or write it":"hoặc viết ra","The facts":"Các sự việc","A strong account usually says:":"Một bản tường trình tốt thường nêu:","who did what, when and where, with dates if you know them;":"ai đã làm gì, khi nào và ở đâu, kèm ngày tháng nếu bạn biết;","what officials did or failed to do;":"cán bộ nhà nước đã làm gì hoặc không làm gì;","the harm caused, and what is happening now.":"thiệt hại gây ra, và tình hình hiện nay.","Rights and remedies":"Quyền và biện pháp khắc phục","These rights are suggested from your answers for the body you chose. Untick any that do not fit; the officer will refine them.":"Các quyền này được gợi ý từ câu trả lời của bạn cho cơ quan bạn chọn. Bỏ chọn những quyền không phù hợp; cán bộ sẽ điều chỉnh thêm.","National remedies":"Biện pháp khắc phục trong nước","Other international procedures":"Các thủ tục quốc tế khác","What you are asking for":"Điều bạn yêu cầu","Remedy sought":"Biện pháp khắc phục yêu cầu","(for example release, compensation, halting a deportation, an investigation)":"(ví dụ: trả tự do, bồi thường, dừng trục xuất, một cuộc điều tra)","Documents":"Giấy tờ","Documents you have":"Giấy tờ bạn có","(court decisions, medical reports, contracts, ID). Do not upload them here; the officer will ask for copies.":"(quyết định của tòa án, giấy khám bệnh, hợp đồng, giấy tờ tùy thân). Đừng tải lên ở đây; cán bộ sẽ xin bản sao.","Review and send":"Xem lại và gửi","Read the draft below. When you send it, it goes only to the IMR International Legal Clinic, not to any international body. An officer will contact you to review it.":"Đọc bản nháp bên dưới. Khi bạn gửi, bản nháp chỉ đến Phòng tư vấn pháp lý quốc tế IMR, không đến bất kỳ cơ quan quốc tế nào. Một cán bộ sẽ liên hệ để cùng bạn xem lại.","Your reference:":"Mã hồ sơ của bạn:","Keep it in case you need to contact the Clinic.":"Hãy giữ lại phòng khi cần liên hệ Phòng tư vấn.","How we handle your data: the form is stored by our web host, Netlify, whose servers are mostly in the United States, and is then read only by Clinic staff. If that is a risk for you, download the draft instead and send it to":"Cách chúng tôi xử lý dữ liệu của bạn: mẫu đơn được lưu bởi nhà cung cấp web của chúng tôi, Netlify, có máy chủ chủ yếu ở Hoa Kỳ, và sau đó chỉ nhân viên Phòng tư vấn được đọc. Nếu điều đó gây rủi ro cho bạn, hãy tải bản nháp về và gửi tới","or bring it to the Clinic.":"hoặc mang đến Phòng tư vấn.","Download (.doc)":"Tải về (.doc)","Send to an IMR lawyer":"Gửi cho luật sư IMR","Step":"Bước","← Back to results":"← Quay lại kết quả","Live preview":"Xem trước trực tiếp","Sending…":"Đang gửi…","The draft could not be sent just now.":"Hiện chưa gửi được bản nháp.","Microphone not allowed. Please write instead.":"Không được phép dùng micro. Vui lòng viết thay.","Draft in your language":"Bản nháp bằng ngôn ngữ của bạn","Draft in English":"Bản nháp bằng tiếng Anh","DRAFT FOR REVIEW BY THE IMR INTERNATIONAL LEGAL CLINIC. NOT YET SUBMITTED.":"BẢN NHÁP ĐỂ PHÒNG TƯ VẤN PHÁP LÝ QUỐC TẾ IMR XEM XÉT. CHƯA NỘP.","To":"Gửi đến","Type":"Loại","Date":"Ngày","IMR reference":"Mã hồ sơ IMR","INFORMATION ON THE AUTHOR":"THÔNG TIN VỀ NGƯỜI GỬI","Name":"Họ tên","Address for correspondence":"Địa chỉ liên lạc","to be completed with the Clinic":"sẽ hoàn thiện cùng Phòng tư vấn","INFORMATION ON THE ALLEGED VICTIM":"THÔNG TIN VỀ NẠN NHÂN","The author is the alleged victim.":"Người gửi chính là nạn nhân.","Present location":"Nơi ở hiện nay","Authority to act":"Ủy quyền hành động","written consent of the victim to be attached":"sẽ đính kèm văn bản đồng ý của nạn nhân","STATE CONCERNED":"QUỐC GIA LIÊN QUAN","FACTS OF THE CASE":"CÁC SỰ VIỆC CỦA VỤ VIỆC","RIGHTS ALLEGED TO HAVE BEEN VIOLATED":"CÁC QUYỀN BỊ CHO LÀ VI PHẠM","to be identified":"sẽ xác định sau","EXHAUSTION OF DOMESTIC REMEDIES":"VIỆC SỬ DỤNG HẾT CÁC BIỆN PHÁP KHẮC PHỤC TRONG NƯỚC","Remedies unavailable or ineffective because":"Các biện pháp khắc phục không có sẵn hoặc không hiệu quả vì","OTHER INTERNATIONAL PROCEDURES":"CÁC THỦ TỤC QUỐC TẾ KHÁC","REMEDY SOUGHT":"BIỆN PHÁP KHẮC PHỤC YÊU CẦU","Request for interim measures":"Đề nghị áp dụng biện pháp tạm thời","the author asks that the State be requested to take interim measures to avoid irreparable harm to the alleged victim while the communication is under consideration.":"người gửi đề nghị yêu cầu Quốc gia áp dụng biện pháp tạm thời để tránh thiệt hại không thể khắc phục cho nạn nhân trong thời gian thông tin khiếu nại đang được xem xét.","SUPPORTING DOCUMENTS":"GIẤY TỜ KÈM THEO","to be listed":"sẽ liệt kê sau","Signature":"Chữ ký","not yet given":"chưa cung cấp","The same matter has not been submitted to any other procedure of international investigation or settlement.":"Vấn đề này chưa được gửi đến bất kỳ thủ tục điều tra hoặc giải quyết quốc tế nào khác.","Told in a voice message, attached. The Clinic will transcribe it.":"Đã kể bằng tin nhắn thoại, kèm theo. Phòng tư vấn sẽ chép lại thành văn bản.","A voice message is also attached.":"Có kèm một tin nhắn thoại.","Draft for IMR review · not yet submitted":"Bản nháp để IMR xem xét · chưa nộp","Easy mode: big pictures, questions read aloud":"Chế độ dễ dùng: hình lớn, câu hỏi được đọc to","Recruiting agency and employer":"Công ty môi giới và chủ sử dụng lao động","(if any)":"(nếu có)","Recruiting agency or agent":"Công ty môi giới hoặc người môi giới","Name of the company or person who arranged the job":"Tên công ty hoặc người đã sắp xếp công việc","Employer":"Chủ sử dụng lao động","Name of the employer, farm or household":"Tên chủ sử dụng lao động, trang trại hoặc gia đình","Which country?":"Quốc gia nào?","I'm not sure":"Tôi không chắc","Choose a country":"Chọn một quốc gia","Has that country accepted individual communications to UN treaty committees?":"Nước đó có chấp nhận thông tin cá nhân (communication) gửi các ủy ban điều ước của Liên Hợp Quốc không?","Find out which international bodies can hear your case. Then draft your rights communication step by step, and an IMR lawyer reviews it with you before anything is filed.":"Tìm hiểu những cơ quan quốc tế nào có thể xem xét vụ việc của bạn. Sau đó soạn thông tin về quyền của bạn từng bước, và một luật sư của IMR sẽ cùng bạn xem lại trước khi nộp bất cứ điều gì.","This lets us check which UN communication procedures that country has accepted.":"Điều này giúp chúng tôi kiểm tra quốc gia đó đã chấp nhận những thủ tục gửi thông tin cá nhân nào của Liên Hợp Quốc.","Before anything is filed, the person affected must sign an authorization letting you, or IMR, act for them. If they cannot sign, for example because they are detained, the Clinic officer will explain what can be done instead.":"Trước khi nộp bất cứ điều gì, người bị ảnh hưởng phải ký giấy ủy quyền cho bạn, hoặc IMR, hành động thay mặt họ. Nếu họ không thể ký, ví dụ vì đang bị giam giữ, cán bộ Phòng tư vấn sẽ giải thích có thể làm gì thay thế."}};
